004943,003308: E6,1541  E6,1712               HDISP              EQUALS   VDISP      +2                 	# I(2)OUT       2(29) M
004944,003309: E6,1541  E6,1714               HDOTDISP           EQUALS   HDISP      +2                 	# I(2)OUT       2(7) M/CS
