007783,000312:                                                                                          	# ERASCHK TEMPORARILY STORES THE CONTENTS OF TWO ERASABLE LOCATIONS, X
007784,000313:                                                                                          	# AND X+1 INTO SKEEP5 AND SKEEP6.  IT ALSO STORES X INTO SKEEP7 AND
007785,000314:                                                                                          	# ERESTORE.  IF ERASCHK IS INTERRUPTED BY A RESTART, C(ERESTORE) SHOULD
007786,000315:                                                                                          	# EQUAL C(SKEEP7),AND SHOULD BE A + NUMBER LESS THAN 2000 OCT.  OTHERWISE
007787,000316:                                                                                          	# C(ERESTORE) SHOULD EQUAL +0.
