010201,000004:                                                                                          	## Purpose:     Part of the source code for Comanche, build 055. It
010202,000005:                                                                                          	##              is part of the source code for the Command Module's
010203,000006:                                                                                          	##              (CM) Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC), Apollo 11.
010204,000007:                                                                                          	## Assembler:   yaYUL
010205,000008:                                                                                          	## Reference:   pp. 236-267
010206,000009:                                                                                          	## Contact:     Ron Burkey <info@sandroid.org>,
010207,000010:                                                                                          	##              Fabrizio Bernardini <fabrizio@spacecraft.it>
010208,000011:                                                                                          	## Website:     http://www.ibiblio.org/apollo.
010209,000012:                                                                                          	## Mod history: 2009-05-18 FB   Transcription Batch 3 Assignment.
010210,000013:                                                                                          	##              2009-05-20 RSB  Corrections:  POODOO -> POODOO,
010211,000014:                                                                                          	##                              GOTOPOOH -> GOTOPOOH, added a couple of 
010212,000015:                                                                                          	##                              missing instructions in Verb 96.
010213,000016:                                                                                          	##              2009-05-23 RSB  In SYSTEST, corrected TC FLAGWRD1 to 
010214,000017:                                                                                          	##                              CA FLAGWRD1.  Added a variety of SBANK=
010215,000018:                                                                                          	##                              statements prior to 2CADRs.  One day I'll
010216,000019:                                                                                          	##                              have to figure out what yaYUL is doing 
010217,000020:                                                                                          	##                              wrong with those ....
010218,000021:                                                                                          	##              2010-08-29 JL   Fixed +3 and +8 pseudo-labels which were accidentally symbols.
010219,000022:                                                                                          	##              2011-05-08 JL   Flagged SBANK= workarounds for future removal.
010220,000023:                                                                                          	##              2011-05-17 JL   Removed all SBANK= workarounds.
010221,000024:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-10 RSB  Proofed comments with octopus/ProoferComments
010222,000025:                                                                                          	##                              and fixed the errors found.
010223,000026:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-10 RSB  All of the GOTOPOOH's should have been
010224,000027:                                                                                          	##                              GOTOPOOH, and I've changed them back.
