014946,001724:                                                                                          	# ANY NOUN, EXCEPT MIXED NOUNS. IT DISPLAYS THE CONTENTS
014947,001725:                                                                                          	# OF THE REGISTER NOUNADD IS POINTING TO .  IF USED WITH NOUNS WHICH ARE
014948,001726:                                                                                          	# INHERENTLY NOT DP SUCH AS THE CDU COUNTERS THE DISPLAY WILL BE GARBAGE.
