014975,001753:                                                                                          	# LOAD VERBS           IF ALARM CONDITION IS DETECTED DURING EXECUTE,
014976,001754:                                                                                          	# CHECK FAIL LIGHT IS TURNED ON AND ENDOFJOB. IF ALARM CONDITION IS
014977,001755:                                                                                          	# DETECTED DURING ENTER OF DATA, CHECK FAIL IS TURNED ON AND IT RECYCLES
014978,001756:                                                                                          	# TO EXECUTE OF ORIGINAL LOAD VERB.  RECYCLE CAUSED BY  1) DECIMAL MACHINE
014979,001757:                                                                                          	# CADR  2) MIXTURE OF OCTAL/DECIMAL DATA  3) OCTAL DATA INTO DECIMAL
014980,001758:                                                                                          	# ONLY NOUN  4) DEC DATA INTO OCT ONLY NOUN  5) DATA TOO LARGE FOR SCALE
014981,001759:                                                                                          	# 6) FEWER THAN 3 DATA WORDS LOADED FOR HRS, MIN, SEC NOUN.8(2)-(6) ALARM
014982,001760:                                                                                          	# AND RECYCLE OCCUR AT FINAL ENTER OF SET. (1) ALARM AND RECYCLE OCCUR AT
014983,001761:                                                                                          	# ENTER OF CADR.
