016715,003493:    4421           30156                           DCA      MPAC       +1                 	# LEAVES OVFIND SET TO +/- 1 FOR OF/UF
016716,003494:    4422           20156                           DAS      MPAC       +1                 	#
016717,003495:    4423           60154                           AD       MPAC                          	#
016718,003496:    4424           26154                           ADS      MPAC                          	#
