022309,000100: $P76.agc					        # pp. 511-513
022311,000002:                                                                                          	## Copyright:   Public domain.
022312,000003:                                                                                          	## Filename:    P76.agc
022313,000004:                                                                                          	## Purpose:     Part of the source code for Colossus 2A, AKA Comanche 055.
022314,000005:                                                                                          	##              It is part of the source code for the Command Module's (CM)
022315,000006:                                                                                          	##              Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC), for Apollo 11.
022316,000007:                                                                                          	## Assembler:   yaYUL
022317,000008:                                                                                          	## Contact:     Hartmuth Gutsche <hgutsche@xplornet.com>.
022318,000009:                                                                                          	## Website:     www.ibiblio.org/apollo.
022319,000010:                                                                                          	## Pages:       pp  511-513
022320,000011:                                                                                          	## Mod history: 2009-05-08 HG   Adapting from the Luminary131/ file 
022321,000012:                                                                                          	##                              of the same name, using Comanche055 page 
022322,000013:                                                                                          	##                              images 0511.jpg - 0513.jpg. 
022323,000014:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-10 RSB  Proofed comments with octopus/ProoferComments
022324,000015:                                                                                          	##                              and fixed the errors found.
022325,000016:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-10 RSB  All of the GOTOPOOH's should have been
022326,000017:                                                                                          	##                              GOTOPOOH, and I've changed them back.
022327,000018:                                                                                          	##              2017-01-18 RSB  Fixed comment-text errors noted while diff'ing
022328,000019:                                                                                          	##                              vs Colossus 249.
022329,000020:                                                                                          	##
022330,000021:                                                                                          	## This source code has been transcribed or otherwise adapted from digitized
022331,000022:                                                                                          	## images of a hardcopy from the MIT Museum.  The digitization was performed
022332,000023:                                                                                          	## by Paul Fjeld, and arranged for by Deborah Douglas of the Museum.  Many
022333,000024:                                                                                          	## thanks to both.  The images (with suitable reduction in storage size and
022334,000025:                                                                                          	## consequent reduction in image quality as well) are available online at
022335,000026:                                                                                          	## www.ibiblio.org/apollo.  If for some reason you find that the images are
022336,000027:                                                                                          	## illegible, contact me at info@sandroid.org about getting access to the 
022337,000028:                                                                                          	## (much) higher-quality images which Paul actually created.
022338,000029:                                                                                          	##
022339,000030:                                                                                          	## Notations on the hardcopy document read, in part:
022340,000031:                                                                                          	##
022341,000032:                                                                                          	##    Assemble revision 055 of AGC program Comanche by NASA
022342,000033:                                                                                          	##    2021113-051.  10:28 APR. 1, 1969  
022343,000034:                                                                                          	##
022344,000035:                                                                                          	##    This AGC program shall also be referred to as
022345,000036:                                                                                          	##            Colossus 2A
022346,000037: 
022348,000039:                                                                                          	# 1)    PROGRAM NAME - TARGET DELTA V PROGRAM (P76).
022349,000040:                                                                                          	# 2)    FUNCTIONAL DESCRIPTION - UPON ENTRY BY ASTRONAUT ACTION, P76 FLASHES DSKY REQUESTS TO THE ASTRONAUT
022350,000041:                                                                                          	#       TO PROVIDE VIA DSKY (1) THE DELTA V TO BE APPLIED TO THE OTHER VEHICLE STATE VECTOR AND (2) THE
022351,000042:                                                                                          	#       TIME (TIG) AT WHICH THE OTHER VEHICLE VELOCITY WAS CHANGED BY EXECUTION OF A THRUSTING MANEUVER. THE
022352,000043:                                                                                          	#       OTHER VEHICLE STATE VECTOR IS INTEGRATED TO TIG AND UPDATED BY THE ADDITION OF DELTA V (DELTA V HAVING
022353,000044:                                                                                          	#       BEEN TRANSFORMED FROM LV TO REF COSYS).  USING INTEGRVS, THE PROGRAM THEN INTEGRATES THE OTHER
022354,000045:                                                                                          	#       VEHICLE STATE VECTOR TO THE STATE VECTOR OF THIS VEHICLE, THUS INSURING THAT THE W-MATRIX AND BOTH VEHICLE
022355,000046:                                                                                          	#       STATES CORRESPOND TO THE SAME TIME.
022356,000047:                                                                                          	# 3)    ERASABLE INITIALIZATION REQUIRED - NONE.
022357,000048:                                                                                          	# 4)    CALLING SEQUENCES AND EXIT MODES - CALLED BY ASTRONAUT REQUEST THRU DSKY V 37 E 76E.
022358,000049:                                                                                          	#       EXITS BY TCF ENDOFJOB.
022359,000050:                                                                                          	# 5)    OUTPUT - OTHER VEHICLE STATE VECTOR INTEGRATED TO TIG AND INCREMENTED BY DELTA V IN REF COSYS.
022360,000051:                                                                                          	#       THE PUSHLIST CONTAINS THE MATRIX BY WHICH THE INPUT DELTA V MUST BE POST-MULTIPLIED TO CONVERT FROM LV
022361,000052:                                                                                          	#       TO REF COSYS.
022362,000053:                                                                                          	# 6)    DEBRIS - OTHER VEHICLE STATE VECTOR.
022363,000054:                                                                                          	# 7)    SUBROUTINES CALLED - BANKCALL, GOXDSPF, CSMPREC (OR LEMPREC), ATOPCSM (OR ATOPLEM), INTSTALL, INTWAKE, PHASCHNG
022364,000055:                                                                                          	#       INTPRET, INTEGRVS, AND MINIRECT.
022365,000056:                                                                                          	# 8)    FLAG USE - MOONFLAG, CMOONFLAG, INTYPFLG, RASFLAG, AND MARKCTR.
022366,000057: 
022367,000058: 30,2000                                           BANK     30                            	#
022368,000059: 13,2000                                           SETLOC   P76LOC                        	#
022369,000060: 13,2000                                           BANK                                   	#
