022485,000006:                                                                                          	##              Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC), for Apollo 11.
022486,000007:                                                                                          	## Assembler:   yaYUL
022487,000008:                                                                                          	## Contact:     Hartmuth Gutsche <hgutsche@xplornet.com>.
022488,000009:                                                                                          	## Website:     www.ibiblio.org/apollo.
022489,000010:                                                                                          	## Pages:       514-524
