022979,000003:                                                                                          	## Filename:    STABLE_ORBIT_-_P38-P39.agc
022980,000004:                                                                                          	## Purpose:     Part of the source code for Colossus 2A, AKA Comanche 055.
022981,000005:                                                                                          	##              It is part of the source code for the Command Module's (CM)
022982,000006:                                                                                          	##              Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC), for Apollo 11.
022983,000007:                                                                                          	## Assembler:   yaYUL
022984,000008:                                                                                          	## Contact:     Hartmuth Gutsche <hgutsche@xplornet.com>.
022985,000009:                                                                                          	## Website:     www.ibiblio.org/apollo.
022986,000010:                                                                                          	## Pages:       525-532
022987,000011:                                                                                          	## Mod history: 2009-05-10 HG   Started adapting from the Colossus249/ file
022988,000012:                                                                                          	##                              of the same name, using Comanche055 page
022989,000013:                                                                                          	##                              images 0525.jpg - 0532.jpg.
022990,000014:                                                                                          	##              2010-08-20 JL   Fixed page number comment (p531).
022991,000015:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-10 RSB  Proofed comments with octopus/ProoferComments
022992,000016:                                                                                          	##                              and fixed the errors found.
022993,000017:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-10 RSB  All of the GOTOPOOH's should have been
022994,000018:                                                                                          	##                              GOTOPOOH, and I've changed them back.
022995,000019:                                                                                          	##              2017-01-19 RSB  Renamed from STABLE_ORBIT.agc to agree with 
022996,000020:                                                                                          	##                              the actual name from the log section, and with
022997,000021:                                                                                          	##                              the naming in Colossus 237.
