024919,000002:                                                                                          	## Copyright:   Public domain.
024920,000003:                                                                                          	## Filename:    P20-P25.agc
024921,000004:                                                                                          	## Purpose:     Part of the source code for Colossus 2A, AKA Comanche 055.
024922,000005:                                                                                          	##              It is part of the source code for the Command Module's (CM)
024923,000006:                                                                                          	##              Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC), for Apollo 11.
024924,000007:                                                                                          	## Assembler:   yaYUL
024925,000008:                                                                                          	## Contact:     Ron Burkey <info@sandroid.org>.
024926,000009:                                                                                          	## Website:     www.ibiblio.org/apollo.
024927,000010:                                                                                          	## Pages:       562-534
024928,000011:                                                                                          	## Mod history: 2009-05-10 RSB  Adapted from the Colossus249/ file 
024929,000012:                                                                                          	##                              of the same name, using Comanche055 page 
024930,000013:                                                                                          	##                              images. 
024931,000014:                                                                                          	##              2009-05-20 RSB  Corrections:  P2OS -> P20S, STO -> STQ,
024932,000015:                                                                                          	##                              GOTOPOOH -> GOTOPOOH, a duplicated EXTEND
024933,000016:                                                                                          	##                              was fixed, P23.10 -> R23.10, 
024934,000017:                                                                                          	##                              S22B0X44 -> S22BOX44, S22SUBSCL -> 22SUBSCL,
024935,000018:                                                                                          	##                              S22DPP -> S22DSPP, changed some instructions in
024936,000019:                                                                                          	##                              P23.152.
024937,000020:                                                                                          	##              2010-08-24 JL   Fixed page 627 number. Fixed some whitespace.
024938,000021:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-10 RSB  All of the GOTOPOOH's should have been
024939,000022:                                                                                          	##                              GOTOPOOH, and I've changed them back.
024940,000023:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-10 RSB  Proofed comments with octopus/ProoferComments
024941,000024:                                                                                          	##                              and fixed the errors found.
024942,000025:                                                                                          	##              2017-01-16 RSB  Fixed comment-text errors noted while diff'ing
024943,000026:                                                                                          	##                              vs Colossus 249.
024944,000027:                                                                                          	##              2017-02-06 RSB  Fixed comment-text errors noted while proofing
024945,000028:                                                                                          	##                              Artemis 72.
024946,000029:                                                                                          	##              2017-03-17 RSB  Comment-text fixes identified by 4-way diff'ing
024947,000030:                                                                                          	##                              of Colossus 237 & 249, Comanche 55, and Artemis 72.
