024950,000033:                                                                                          	## This source code has been transcribed or otherwise adapted from digitized
024951,000034:                                                                                          	## images of a hardcopy from the MIT Museum.  The digitization was performed
024952,000035:                                                                                          	## by Paul Fjeld, and arranged for by Deborah Douglas of the Museum.  Many
024953,000036:                                                                                          	## thanks to both.  The images (with suitable reduction in storage size and
024954,000037:                                                                                          	## consequent reduction in image quality as well) are available online at
024955,000038:                                                                                          	## www.ibiblio.org/apollo.  If for some reason you find that the images are
024956,000039:                                                                                          	## illegible, contact me at info@sandroid.org about getting access to the 
024957,000040:                                                                                          	## (much) higher-quality images which Paul actually created.
024958,000041:                                                                                          	##
024959,000042:                                                                                          	## Notations on the hardcopy document read, in part:
024960,000043:                                                                                          	##
024961,000044:                                                                                          	##      Assemble revision 055 of AGC program Comanche by NASA
024962,000045:                                                                                          	##      2021113-051.  10:28 APR. 1, 1969  
