028412,000108: $P30,P37.agc					        # pp. 635-648
028414,000002:                                                                                          	## Copyright:   Public domain.
028415,000003:                                                                                          	## Filename:    P30-P37.agc
028416,000004:                                                                                          	## Purpose:     Part of the source code for Colossus 2A, AKA Comanche 055.
028417,000005:                                                                                          	##              It is part of the source code for the Command Module's (CM)
028418,000006:                                                                                          	##              Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC), for Apollo 11.
028419,000007:                                                                                          	## Assembler:   yaYUL
028420,000008:                                                                                          	## Contact:     Ron Burkey <info@sandroid.org>.
028421,000009:                                                                                          	## Website:     www.ibiblio.org/apollo.
028422,000010:                                                                                          	## Pages:       635-648
028423,000011:                                                                                          	## Mod history: 2009-05-10 RSB  Adapted from the Colossus249/ file 
028424,000012:                                                                                          	##                              of the same name, using Comanche055 page 
028425,000013:                                                                                          	##                              images.
028426,000014:                                                                                          	##              2009-05-20 RSB  Corrected BDV -> BOV.
028427,000015:                                                                                          	##              2010-08-24 JL   Fixed page numbers, some whitespace.
028428,000016:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-10 RSB  All of the GOTOPOOH's should have been
028429,000017:                                                                                          	##                              GOTOPOOH, and I've changed them back.
028430,000018:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-11 RSB  Proofed comments with octopus/ProoferComments
028431,000019:                                                                                          	##                              and fixed the errors found.
028432,000020:                                                                                          	##              2017-01-17 RSB  Fixed comment-text errors noted while diff'ing
028433,000021:                                                                                          	##                              vs Colossus 249.
028434,000022:                                                                                          	##
028435,000023:                                                                                          	## This source code has been transcribed or otherwise adapted from digitized
028436,000024:                                                                                          	## images of a hardcopy from the MIT Museum.  The digitization was performed
028437,000025:                                                                                          	## by Paul Fjeld, and arranged for by Deborah Douglas of the Museum.  Many
028438,000026:                                                                                          	## thanks to both.  The images (with suitable reduction in storage size and
028439,000027:                                                                                          	## consequent reduction in image quality as well) are available online at
028440,000028:                                                                                          	## www.ibiblio.org/apollo.  If for some reason you find that the images are
028441,000029:                                                                                          	## illegible, contact me at info@sandroid.org about getting access to the 
028442,000030:                                                                                          	## (much) higher-quality images which Paul actually created.
028443,000031:                                                                                          	##
028444,000032:                                                                                          	## Notations on the hardcopy document read, in part:
028445,000033:                                                                                          	##
028446,000034:                                                                                          	##      Assemble revision 055 of AGC program Comanche by NASA
028447,000035:                                                                                          	##      2021113-051.  10:28 APR. 1, 1969  
028448,000036:                                                                                          	##
028449,000037:                                                                                          	##      This AGC program shall also be referred to as
028450,000038:                                                                                          	##                      Colossus 2A
