030447,000002:                                                                                          	## Copyright:   Public domain.
030448,000003:                                                                                          	## Filename:    P40-P47.agc
030449,000004:                                                                                          	## Purpose:     Part of the source code for Colossus 2A, AKA Comanche 055.
030450,000005:                                                                                          	##              It is part of the source code for the Command Module's (CM)
030451,000006:                                                                                          	##              Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC), for Apollo 11.
030452,000007:                                                                                          	## Assembler:   yaYUL
030453,000008:                                                                                          	## Contact:     Ron Burkey <info@sandroid.org>.
030454,000009:                                                                                          	## Website:     www.ibiblio.org/apollo.
030455,000010:                                                                                          	## Pages:       684-736
030456,000011:                                                                                          	## Mod history: 2009-05-11 RSB  Adapted from the Colossus249/ file 
030457,000012:                                                                                          	##                              of the same name, using Comanche055 page 
030458,000013:                                                                                          	##                              images.  
030459,000014:                                                                                          	##              2009-05-20 RSB  In S20.1, a DMP DDV was corrected to DMPR DDV.
030460,000015:                                                                                          	##              2009-05-22 RSB  In BESTTRIM, TC PACTOFF corrected to
030461,000016:                                                                                          	##                              TS PACTOFF.
030462,000017:                                                                                          	##              2009-05-23 RSB  Prior to the 2CADR at T5IDLDAP, added an 
030463,000018:                                                                                          	##                              SBANK.
030464,000019:                                                                                          	##              2010-08-28 JL   Fixed indentation.
030465,000020:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-10 RSB  All of the GOTOPOOH's should have been
030466,000021:                                                                                          	##                              GOTOPOOH, and I've changed them back.
030467,000022:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-11 RSB  Proofed comments with octopus/ProoferComments
030468,000023:                                                                                          	##                              and fixed the errors found.
030469,000024:                                                                                          	##              2017-01-18 RSB  Fixed comment-text errors noted while diff'ing
030470,000025:                                                                                          	##                              vs Colossus 249.
030471,000026:                                                                                          	##              2017-06-17 MAS  Globally removed all SBANK= workarounds.
030472,000027:                                                                                          	##
030473,000028:                                                                                          	## This source code has been transcribed or otherwise adapted from digitized
030474,000029:                                                                                          	## images of a hardcopy from the MIT Museum.  The digitization was performed
030475,000030:                                                                                          	## by Paul Fjeld, and arranged for by Deborah Douglas of the Museum.  Many
030476,000031:                                                                                          	## thanks to both.  The images (with suitable reduction in storage size and
030477,000032:                                                                                          	## consequent reduction in image quality as well) are available online at
030478,000033:                                                                                          	## www.ibiblio.org/apollo.  If for some reason you find that the images are
030479,000034:                                                                                          	## illegible, contact me at info@sandroid.org about getting access to the 
