032885,000002:                                                                                          	## Copyright:   Public domain.
032886,000003:                                                                                          	## Filename:    P51-P53.agc
032887,000004:                                                                                          	## Purpose:     Part of the source code for Comanche, build 055. It
032888,000005:                                                                                          	##              is part of the source code for the Command Module's
032889,000006:                                                                                          	##              (CM) Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC), Apollo 11.
032890,000007:                                                                                          	## Assembler:   yaYUL
032891,000008:                                                                                          	## Reference:   pp. 737-784
032892,000009:                                                                                          	## Contact:     Ron Burkey <info@sandroid.org>
032893,000010:                                                                                          	## Website:     http://www.ibiblio.org/apollo.
032894,000011:                                                                                          	## Mod history: 2009-05-12 RSB  Adapted from Colossus249 file of the same
032895,000012:                                                                                          	##                              name, and Comanche 055 page images.
032896,000013:                                                                                          	##              2009-05-20 RSB  Corrections: SETI/PDT -> SET1/PDT, 
032897,000014:                                                                                          	##                              GOTOPOOH -> GOTOPOOH, R33EXIT -> R53EXIT,
032898,000015:                                                                                          	##                              V853 -> VB53, R56A -> R56A1 (some places
032899,000016:                                                                                          	##                              only), added missing R56A1 label, added a
032900,000017:                                                                                          	##                              missing CAF in COARSTYP, corrected a SETLOC
032901,000018:                                                                                          	##                              from P50S to P50S3.
032902,000019:                                                                                          	##              2009-05-21 RSB  In COARFINE, a TC BANKCALL was corrected to
032903,000020:                                                                                          	##                              TC PHASCHNG.  In R53C, a CADR GOFLASHR was
032904,000021:                                                                                          	##                              corrected to CADR GOFLASH.
032905,000022:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-10 RSB  All of the GOTOPOOH's should have been
032906,000023:                                                                                          	##                              GOTOPOOH, and I've changed them back.
032907,000024:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-11 RSB  Proofed comments with octopus/ProoferComments
032908,000025:                                                                                          	##                              and fixed the errors found.
032909,000026:                                                                                          	##              2017-01-18 RSB  Fixed comment-text errors noted while diff'ing
032910,000027:                                                                                          	##                              vs Colossus 249.
