037119,000558:                                                                                          	#           6-8 SECS FOR FAILURE
037120,000559: 
037122,000561:                                                                                          	# NORMLIZE PERFORMS THE INITIALIZATION REQUIRED PRIOR TO THE FIRST ENTRY TO AVERAGEG, AND SCALES RN SO THAT IT
037123,000562:                                                                                          	# HAS 1 LEADING BINARY ZERO.  IN MOST MISSIONS, RN WILL BE SCALED AT 2(+29), BUT IN THE 206 MISSION, RN WILL BE
037124,000563:                                                                                          	# SCALED AT 2(+24) M.
