037754,000003:                                                                                          	## Filename:    REENTRY_CONTROL.agc
037755,000004:                                                                                          	## Purpose:     Part of the source code for Colossus 2A, AKA Comanche 055.
037756,000005:                                                                                          	##              It is part of the source code for the Command Module's (CM)
037757,000006:                                                                                          	##              Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC), for Apollo 11.
037758,000007:                                                                                          	## Assembler:   yaYUL
037759,000008:                                                                                          	## Contact:     Ron Burkey <info@sandroid.org>.
037760,000009:                                                                                          	## Website:     www.ibiblio.org/apollo.
037761,000010:                                                                                          	## Pages:       844-882
037762,000011:                                                                                          	## Mod history: 2009-05-08 RSB  Adapted from the Colossus249/ file of the
037763,000012:                                                                                          	##                              same name, using Comanche055 page images.
037764,000013:                                                                                          	##              2009-05-23 RSB  In a couple of 2OCT statements, removed the
037765,000014:                                                                                          	##                              space between the first and second octal words.
037766,000015:                                                                                          	##              2010-08-28 JL   Added missing comment character. Fixed indentation. 
037767,000016:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-18 RSB  Proofed comment text using octopus/ProoferComments
037768,000017:                                                                                          	##                              and corrected the errors found.
037769,000018:                                                                                          	##              2017-01-18 RSB  Fixed comment-text errors noted while diff'ing
037770,000019:                                                                                          	##                              vs Colossus 249.
037771,000020:                                                                                          	##              2021-05-30 ABS  Added empty page 882 to match scans.
037772,000021:                                                                                          	##
037773,000022:                                                                                          	## This source code has been transcribed or otherwise adapted from digitized
037774,000023:                                                                                          	## images of a hardcopy from the MIT Museum.  The digitization was performed
