042755,000005:                                                                                          	##              It is part of the source code for the Command Module's (CM)
042756,000006:                                                                                          	##              Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC), for Apollo 11.
042757,000007:                                                                                          	## Assembler:   yaYUL
042758,000008:                                                                                          	## Contact:     Ron Burkey <info@sandroid.org>.
042759,000009:                                                                                          	## Website:     www.ibiblio.org/apollo.
042760,000010:                                                                                          	## Pages:       956-960
042761,000011:                                                                                          	## Mod history: 2009-05-13 RSB  Adapted from the Colossus249/ file of the
042762,000012:                                                                                          	##                              same name, using Comanche055 page images.
