044806,000004:                                                                                          	## Purpose:     Part of the source code for Colossus 2A, AKA Comanche 055.
044807,000005:                                                                                          	##              It is part of the source code for the Command Module's (CM)
044808,000006:                                                                                          	##              Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC), for Apollo 11.
044809,000007:                                                                                          	## Assembler:   yaYUL
044810,000008:                                                                                          	## Contact:     Ron Burkey <info@sandroid.org>.
044811,000009:                                                                                          	## Website:     www.ibiblio.org/apollo.
044812,000010:                                                                                          	## Pages:       1002-1024
044813,000011:                                                                                          	## Mod history: 2009-05-13 RSB  Adapted from the Colossus249/ file of the
044814,000012:                                                                                          	##                              same name, using Comanche055 page images.
044815,000013:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-21 RSB  Proofed comment text using octopus/ProoferComments
044816,000014:                                                                                          	##                              and corrected the errors found.
044817,000015:                                                                                          	##              2017-01-18 RSB  Fixed comment-text errors noted while diff'ing
044818,000016:                                                                                          	##                              vs Colossus 249.
044819,000017:                                                                                          	##
044820,000018:                                                                                          	## This source code has been transcribed or otherwise adapted from digitized
044821,000019:                                                                                          	## images of a hardcopy from the MIT Museum.  The digitization was performed
044822,000020:                                                                                          	## by Paul Fjeld, and arranged for by Deborah Douglas of the Museum.  Many
044823,000021:                                                                                          	## thanks to both.  The images (with suitable reduction in storage size and
