045788,000002:                                                                                          	## Copyright:   Public domain.
045789,000003:                                                                                          	## Filename:    AUTOMATIC_MANEUVERS.agc
045790,000004:                                                                                          	## Purpose:     Part of the source code for Colossus 2A, AKA Comanche 055.
045791,000005:                                                                                          	##              It is part of the source code for the Command Module's (CM)
045792,000006:                                                                                          	##              Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC), for Apollo 11.
045793,000007:                                                                                          	## Assembler:   yaYUL
045794,000008:                                                                                          	## Contact:     Ron Burkey <info@sandroid.org>.
045795,000009:                                                                                          	## Website:     www.ibiblio.org/apollo.
045796,000010:                                                                                          	## Pages:       1025-1036
045797,000011:                                                                                          	## Mod history: 2009-05-13 RSB  Adapted from the Colossus249/ file of the
045798,000012:                                                                                          	##                              same name, using Comanche055 page images.
045799,000013:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-21 RSB  Proofed comment text using octopus/ProoferComments
045800,000014:                                                                                          	##                              and corrected the errors found.
045801,000015:                                                                                          	##              2017-01-07 RSB  Fixed comment errors detected in cross-diff vs
045802,000016:                                                                                          	##                              Colossus 237 and Colossus 249.
045803,000017:                                                                                          	##
045804,000018:                                                                                          	## This source code has been transcribed or otherwise adapted from digitized
045805,000019:                                                                                          	## images of a hardcopy from the MIT Museum.  The digitization was performed
045806,000020:                                                                                          	## by Paul Fjeld, and arranged for by Deborah Douglas of the Museum.  Many
045807,000021:                                                                                          	## thanks to both.  The images (with suitable reduction in storage size and
045808,000022:                                                                                          	## consequent reduction in image quality as well) are available online at
045809,000023:                                                                                          	## www.ibiblio.org/apollo.  If for some reason you find that the images are
045810,000024:                                                                                          	## illegible, contact me at info@sandroid.org about getting access to the 
045811,000025:                                                                                          	## (much) higher-quality images which Paul actually created.
045812,000026:                                                                                          	##
045813,000027:                                                                                          	## Notations on the hardcopy document read, in part:
045814,000028:                                                                                          	##
045815,000029:                                                                                          	##      Assemble revision 055 of AGC program Comanche by NASA
045816,000030:                                                                                          	##      2021113-051.  10:28 APR. 1, 1969  
