047272,000891: 17,3674           03700                           TC       REPLACER                      	#
047273,000892: 17,3675           45017                           CS       ONE                           	#
047274,000893: 17,3676           55463                           TS       BLAST2                        	#
047275,000894: 17,3677           15333                           TCF      RESUME                        	#
