049608,000355:    6316           12521                           TCF      BPL/BMN                       	# 13 -- BRANCH PLUS AND BRANCH MINUS.
049609,000356:    6317           12474                           TCF      RTB/BHIZ                      	# 14 -- RETURN TO BASIC AND BRANCH HI ZERO.
