050645,001392: 
050646,001393:                                                                                          	# Page 1150
050647,001394:                                                                                          	# THE FOLLOWING IS THE PROLOGUE TO V/SC.  IF THE PRESENT MODE IS VECTOR, IT SAVES THE SCALAR AT X IN BUF
050648,001395:                                                                                          	# AND CALLS THE V/SC ROUTINE IN BANK 0.  IF THE PRESENT MODE IS SCALAR, IT MOVES THE VECTOR AT X INTO MPAC, SAVING
050649,001396:                                                                                          	# THE SCALAR IN MPAC IN BUF BEFORE CALLING THE V/SC ROUTINE IN BANK 0.
050650,001397: 
