051961,002708: 00,3607           33630        ARCSIN             CAF      LASINEX                       	# COMPUTE ARCSIN BY USING THE IDENTITY
051962,002709: 00,3610           13612                           TCF      +2                            	# ARCSIN(X) = PI/2 - ARCCOS(X).
051963,002710: 
