052336,000019:                                                                                          	## thanks to both.  The images (with suitable reduction in storage size and
052337,000020:                                                                                          	## consequent reduction in image quality as well) are available online at
052338,000021:                                                                                          	## www.ibiblio.org/apollo.  If for some reason you find that the images are
