053053,000302:                                                                                          	# Page 1216
053054,000303:                                                                                          	# TO WAKE UP A JOB, EACH CORE SET IS FOUND TO LOCATE ALL JOBS WHICH ARE ASLEEP.  IF THE FCADR IN THE
053055,000304:                                                                                          	# LOC REGISTER OF ANY SUCH JOB MATCHES THAT SUPPLIED BY THE CALLER, THAT JOB IS AWAKENED.  IF NO JOB IS FOUND,
053056,000305:                                                                                          	# LOCCTR IS SET TO -1 AND NO FURTHER ACTION TAKES PLACE.
