056993,000024:                                                                                          	##
056994,000025:                                                                                          	## This source code has been transcribed or otherwise adapted from digitized
056995,000026:                                                                                          	## images of a hardcopy from the MIT Museum.  The digitization was performed
056996,000027:                                                                                          	## by Paul Fjeld, and arranged for by Deborah Douglas of the Museum.  Many
056997,000028:                                                                                          	## thanks to both.  The images (with suitable reduction in storage size and
056998,000029:                                                                                          	## consequent reduction in image quality as well) are available online at
056999,000030:                                                                                          	## www.ibiblio.org/apollo.  If for some reason you find that the images are
057000,000031:                                                                                          	## illegible, contact me at info@sandroid.org about getting access to the 
057001,000032:                                                                                          	## (much) higher-quality images which Paul actually created.
057002,000033:                                                                                          	##
057003,000034:                                                                                          	## Notations on the hardcopy document read, in part:
057004,000035:                                                                                          	##
057005,000036:                                                                                          	##      Assemble revision 055 of AGC program Comanche by NASA
057006,000037:                                                                                          	##      2021113-051.  10:28 APR. 1, 1969  
057007,000038:                                                                                          	##
057008,000039:                                                                                          	##      This AGC program shall also be referred to as
057009,000040:                                                                                          	##                      Colossus 2A
057010,000041: 
057012,000043:                                                                                          	# 1.0 INTRODUCTION
057013,000044:                                                                                          	# ----------------
057014,000045: 
057015,000046:                                                                                          	# FROM A USERS POINT OF VIEW, ORBITAL INTEGRATION IS ESSENTIALLY THE SAME AS THE 278 INTEGRATION
057016,000047:                                                                                          	# PROGRAM.  THE SAME ENTRANCES TO THE PROGRAM WILL BE MAINTAINED, THE SAME STALLING ROUTINE WILL BE USED AND
057017,000048:                                                                                          	# OUTPUT WILL STILL BE VIA THE PUSHLIST.  THE PRIMARY DIFFERENCES TO A USER INVOLVE THE ADDED CAPABILITY OF
057018,000049:                                                                                          	# TERMINATING INTEGRATION AT A SPECIFIC FINAL RADIUS AND THE DIFFERENCE IN STATE VECTOR SCALING INSIDE AND OUT-
057019,000050:                                                                                          	# SIDE THE LUNAR SPHERE OF INFLUENCE.
057020,000051: 
057021,000052:                                                                                          	# IN ORDER TO MAKE THE CSM(LEM)PREC AND CSM(LEM)CONIC ENTRANCES SIMILAR TO FLIGHT 278, THE INTEGRATION PROGRAM
057022,000053:                                                                                          	# WILL ITSELF SET THE FINAL RADIUS (RFINAL) TO 0 SO THAT REACHING THE DESIRED TIME ONLY WILL TERMINATE
057023,000054:                                                                                          	# INTEGRATION.  THE DP REGISTER RFINAL MUST BE SET BY USERS OF INTEGRVS AND INTEGRV, AND MUST BE DONE AFTER THE
057024,000055:                                                                                          	# CALL TC INTSTALL.
057025,000056: 
057026,000057:                                                                                          	# WHEN THE LM IS ON THE LUNAR SURFACE (INDICATED BY LUNAR SURFACE FLAG SET) CALLS TO LEMCONIC, LEMPREC, AND
057027,000058:                                                                                          	# INTEGRV WITH VINFLAG = 0 WILL RESULT IN THE USE OF THE PLANETARY INERTIAL ORIENTATION SUBROUTINES TO PROVIDE
057028,000059:                                                                                          	# BOTH THE LMS POSITION AND VELOCITY IN THE REFERENCE COORDINATE SYSTEM.
057029,000060:                                                                                          	# THE PROGRAM WILL PROVIDE OUTPUT AS IF INTEGRATION WAS USED.  THAT IS, THE PUSHLIST WILL BE SET AS NOTED BELOW AND
057030,000061:                                                                                          	# THE PERMANENT STATE VECTOR UPDATED WHEN SPECIFIED BY AN INTEGRV CALL.
057031,000062: 
057032,000063:                                                                                          	# USERS OF INTEGRVS DESIRING INTEGRATION (INTYPFLG = 0) SHOULD NOTE THAT THE OBLATENESS PERTURBATION COMPUTATION
057033,000064:                                                                                          	# IN LUNAR ORBIT IS TIME DEPENDENT.  THEREFORE, THE USER SHOULD SUPPLY AN INITIAL STATE VECTOR VALID AT SOME REAL
057034,000065:                                                                                          	# TIME AND THE DESIRED TIME (TDEC1) ALSO AT SOME REAL TIME.  FOR CONIC ,,INTEGRATION,, THE USER MAY STILL USE ZERO
057035,000066:                                                                                          	# AS THE INITIAL TIME AND DELTA TIME AS THE DESIRED TIME.
057036,000067: 
057037,000068:                                                                                          	# 2.0 GENERAL DESCRIPTION
057038,000069:                                                                                          	# -----------------------
057039,000070: 
057040,000071:                                                                                          	# THE INTEGRATION PROGRAM OPERATES AS A CLOSED INTERPRETIVE SUBROUTINE AND PERFORMS THESE FUNCTIONS ---
057041,000072:                                                                                          	#       1) INTEGRATES (PRECISION OR CONIC) EITHER CSM OR LM STATE VECTOR
057042,000073:                                                                                          	#       2) INTEGRATES THE W-MATRIX
057043,000074:                                                                                          	#       3) PERMANENT OR TEMPORARY UPDATE OF THE STATE VECTOR
057044,000075: 
057045,000076:                                                                                          	# THERE ARE SIX ENTRANCES TO THE INTEGRATION PROGRAM.  FOUR OF THESE (CSMPREC, LEMPREC, CSMCONIC, LEMCONIC) SET
057046,000077:                                                                                          	# ALL THE FLAGS REQUIRED IN THE INTEGRATION PROGRAM ITSELF TO CAUSE THE PRECISION OR CONIC INTEGRATION (KEPLER) OF
057047,000078:                                                                                          	# THE LM OR CSM STATE VECTOR, AS THE NAMES SUGGEST.  ONE ENTRANCE (INTEGRVS) PERMITS THE CALLING PROGRAM TO
057048,000079:                                                                                          	# PROVIDE A STATE VECTOR TO BE INTEGRATED.  THE CALLING PROGRAM MUST SET THE FLAGS INDICATING (1) PRECISION OR
057049,000080:                                                                                          	# CONIC INTEGRATION, (2) IN OR OUT OF LUNAR SPHERE, (3) MIDCOURSE OR NOT, AND THE INTEGRATION PROGRAM COMPLETES
057050,000081:                                                                                          	# THE FLAG SETTING TO BYPASS W-MATRIX INTEGRATION.  THE LAST ENTRANCE (INTEGRV, USED IN GENERAL BY THE
057051,000082:                                                                                          	# NAVIGATION PROGRAMS) PERMITS THE CALLER TO SET FIVE FLAGS (NOT MOONFLAG OR MIDFLAG) BUT NOT TO INPUT A STATE
057052,000083:                                                                                          	# VECTOR.  ANY PROGRAM WHICH CALLS INTEGRVS OR INTEGRV MUST CALL INTSTALL BEFORE IT SETS THE INTEGRATION FLAGS
057053,000084:                                                                                          	# AND/OR STATE VECTOR.
057054,000085: 
057055,000086:                                                                                          	# THREE SETS OF 42 REGISTERS AND 2 FLAGS ARE USED FOR THE STATE VECTORS.  TWO SETS, WHICH MAY NOT BE OVERLAYED, ARE
057056,000087:                                                                                          	# USED FOR THE PERMANENT STATE VECTORS FOR THE CSM AND LM.  THE THIRD SET, WHICH MAY BE OVERLAYED WHEN INTEGRATION
057057,000088:                                                                                          	# IS NOT BEING DONE, IS USED IN THE COMPUTATIONS.
057058,000089: 
057059,000090:                                                                                          	# THE PERMANENT STATE VECTORS WILL BE PERIODICALLY UPDATED SO THAT THE VECTORS WILL NOT BE OLDER THAN 4 TIMESTEPS.
057060,000091:                                                                                          	# THE PERMANENT STATE VECTORS WILL ALSO BE UPDATED WHENEVER THE W-MATRIX IS INTEGRATED OR WHEN A CALLER OF INTEGRV
057061,000092:                                                                                          	# SETS STATEFLG (THE NAVIGATION PROGRAMS P20, P22.)
057062,000093: 
057064,000095:                                                                                          	# APPENDIX B OF THE USERS GUIDE LISTS THE STATE VECTOR QUANTITIES.
057065,000096: 
057066,000097:                                                                                          	# 2.1 RESTARTS
057067,000098: 
057068,000099:                                                                                          	# PHASE CHANGES WILL BE MADE IN THE INTEGRATION PROGRAM ONLY FOR THE INTEGRV ENTRANCE (I.E., WHEN THE W-MATRIX IS
057069,000100:                                                                                          	# INTEGRATED OR PERMANENT STATE VECTOR IS UPDATED.)  THE GROUP NUMBER USED WILL BE THAT FOR THE P20-25 PROGRAMS
057070,000101:                                                                                          	# (I.E., GROUP2) SINCE THE INTEGRV ENTRANCE WILL ONLY BE USED BY THESE PROGRAMS.  IF A RESTART OCCURS DURING AN
057071,000102:                                                                                          	# INTEGRATION OF THE STATE VECTOR ONLY, THE RECOVERY WILL BE TO THE LAST PHASE IN THE CALLING PROGRAM.  CALLING
057072,000103:                                                                                          	# PROGRAMS WHICH USE THE INTEGRV OR INTEGRVS ENTRANCE OF INTEGRATION SHOULD ENSURE THAT IF PHASE CHANGING IS DONE
057073,000104:                                                                                          	# THAT IT IS PRIOR TO SETTING THE INTEGRATION INPUTS IN THE PUSHLIST.
057074,000105:                                                                                          	# THIS IS BECAUSE THE PUSHLIST IS LOST DURING A RESTART.
057075,000106: 
057076,000107:                                                                                          	# 2.2 SCALING
057077,000108: 
057078,000109:                                                                                          	# THE INTEGRATION ROUTINE WILL MAINTAIN THE PERMANENT MEMORY STATE VECTORS IN THE SCALING AND UNITS DEFINED IN
057079,000110:                                                                                          	# APPENDIX B OF THE USERS GUIDE.  THE SCALING OF THE OUTPUT POSITION VECTOR DEPENDS ON THE ORIGIN OF THE COORDINATE
057080,000111:                                                                                          	# SYSTEM AT THE DESIRED INTEGRATION TIME.  THE COORDINATE SYSTEM TRANSFORMATION WILL BE DONE AUTOMATICALLY ON
057081,000112:                                                                                          	# MULTIPLE TIMESTEP ENCKE INTEGRATION ONLY.  THUS IT IS POSSIBLE TO HAVE OUTPUT FROM SUCCESSIVE INTEGRATIONS IN
057082,000113:                                                                                          	# DIFFERENT SCALING.
057083,000114:                                                                                          	# HOWEVER, RATT, VATT WILL ALWAYS BE SCALED THE SAME.
057084,000115: 
057085,000116:                                                                                          	# 3.0 INPUT/OUTPUT
057086,000117:                                                                                          	# ----------------
057087,000118: 
057088,000119:                                                                                          	# PROGRAM INPUTS ARE THE FLAGS DESCRIBED IN APPENDIX A AND THE PERMANENT STATE VECTOR QUANTITIES DESCRIBED IN AP-
057089,000120:                                                                                          	# PENDIX B OF THE USERS GUIDE, PLUS THE DESIRED TIME TO INTEGRATE TO IN TDEC1 (A PUSH LIST LOCATION).
057090,000121:                                                                                          	# FOR INTEGRVS, THE RCV,VCV,TET OF THE TEMPORARY STATE VECTOR MUST BE SET, PLUS MOONFLAG AND MIDFLAG
057091,000122: 
057092,000123:                                                                                          	# FOR SIMULATION THE FOLLOWING QUANTITIES MUST BE PRESET ---
057093,000124:                                                                                          	#                                                                               EARTH   MOON
057094,000125:                                                                                          	#                                                                                29      27
057095,000126:                                                                                          	#       RRECTCSM(LEM)   -       RECTIFIED POSITION VECTOR       METERS          2       2
057096,000127: 
057097,000128:                                                                                          	#                                                                                7       5
057098,000129:                                                                                          	#       VRECTCSM(LEM)   -       RECTIFIED VELOCITY VECTOR       M/CSEC          2       2
057099,000130: 
057100,000131:                                                                                          	#                                                                                28      28
057101,000132:                                                                                          	#       TETCSM(LEM)     -       TIME STATE VECTOR IS VALID      CSEC            2       2
057102,000133:                                                                                          	#                               CUSTOMARILY 0, BUT NOTE LUNAR
057103,000134:                                                                                          	#                               ORBIT DEPENDENCE ON REAL TIME.
057104,000135: 
057105,000136:                                                                                          	#                                                                                22      18
057106,000137:                                                                                          	#       DELTAVCSM(LEM)  -       POSITION DEVIATION              METERS          2       2
057107,000138:                                                                                          	#                               0 IF TCCSM(LEM) = 0
057108,000139: 
057109,000140:                                                                                          	#                                                                                3       -1
057110,000141:                                                                                          	#       NUVCSM(LEM)     -       VELOCITY DEVIATION              M/CSEC          2       2
057111,000142:                                                                                          	#                               0 IF TCCSM(LEM) = 0
057113,000144:                                                                                          	#                                                                                29      27
057114,000145:                                                                                          	#       RCVCSM(LEM)     -       CONIC POSITION                  METERS          2       2
057115,000146:                                                                                          	#                               EQUALS RRECTCSM(LEM) IF
057116,000147:                                                                                          	#                               TCCSM(LEM) = 0
057117,000148: 
057118,000149:                                                                                          	#                                                                                7       5
057119,000150:                                                                                          	#       VCVCSM(LEM)     -       CONIC VELOCITY                  M/CSEC          2       2
057120,000151:                                                                                          	#                               EQUALS VRECTCSM(LEM) IF
057121,000152:                                                                                          	#                               TCCSM(LEM) = 0
057122,000153: 
057123,000154:                                                                                          	#                                                                                28      28
057124,000155:                                                                                          	#       TCCSM(LEM)      -       TIME SINCE RECTIFICATION        CSECS           2       2
057125,000156:                                                                                          	#                               CUSTOMARILY 0
057126,000157: 
057127,000158:                                                                                          	#                                                                1/2             17      16
057128,000159:                                                                                          	#       XKEPCSM(LEM)    -       ROOT OF KEPLERS EQUATION        M               2       2
057129,000160:                                                                                          	#                               0 IF TCCSM(LEM) = 0
057130,000161: 
057131,000162:                                                                                          	#       CMOONFLG        -       PERMANENT FLAGS CORRESPONDING                   0       0
057132,000163:                                                                                          	#       CMIDFLAG                TO MOONFLAG AND MIDFLAG                         0,1     0,1
057133,000164:                                                                                          	#       LMOONFLG                C = CSM, L = LM                                 0       0
057134,000165:                                                                                          	#       LMIDFLG                                                                 0,1     0,1
057135,000166: 
057136,000167:                                                                                          	#       SURFFLAG        -       LUNAR SURFACE FLAG                              0,1     0,1
057137,000168: 
057138,000169:                                                                                          	# IN ADDITION, IF (L)CMIDFLAG IS SET, THE INITIAL INPUT VALUES FOR LUNAR
057139,000170:                                                                                          	# SOLAR EPHEMERIDES SUBROUTINE AND PLANETARY INERTIAL ORIENTATION SUB-
057140,000171:                                                                                          	# ROUTINE MUST BE PRESET.
057141,000172: 
057142,000173:                                                                                          	# OUTPUT
057143,000174:                                                                                          	#       AFTER EVERY CALL TO INTEGRATION
057144,000175:                                                                                          	#                                                                       EARTH   MOON
057145,000176:                                                                                          	#                                                                        29      29
057146,000177:                                                                                          	#       0D      RATT    POSITION                        METERS          2       2
057147,000178: 
057148,000179:                                                                                          	#                                                                        7       7
057149,000180:                                                                                          	#       6D      VATT    VELOCITY                        M/CSEC          2       2
057150,000181: 
057151,000182:                                                                                          	#                                                                        28      28
057152,000183:                                                                                          	#       12D     TAT     TIME                                            2       2
057153,000184: 
057154,000185:                                                                                          	#                                                                        29      27
057155,000186:                                                                                          	#       14D     RATT1   POSITION                        METERS          2       2
057156,000187: 
057157,000188:                                                                                          	#                                                                        7       5
057158,000189:                                                                                          	#       20D     VATT1   VELOCITY                        M/CSEC          2       2
057159,000190: 
057160,000191:                                                                                          	#                                                        3   2           36      30
057161,000192:                                                                                          	#       26D     MU(P)   MU                              M /CS           2       2
057162,000193: 
057163,000194:                                                                                          	#       X1              MUTABLE ENTRY                                   -2      -10D
057164,000195: 
057165,000196:                                                                                          	#       X2              COORDINT
057166,000197:                                                                                          	#       X2              COORDINATE SYSTEM ORIGEN                        0       2
057167,000198:                                                                                          	#                       (THIS, NOT MOONFLAG, SHOULD BE
057169,000200:                                                                                          	#                       USED TO DETERMINE ORIGIN.)
057170,000201: 
057171,000202:                                                                                          	# IN ADDITION TO THE ABOVE, THE PERMANENT STATE VECTOR IS UPDATED WHENEVER
057172,000203:                                                                                          	# STATEFLG WAS SET AND WHENEVER A W-MATRIX IS TO BE INTEGRATED.  THE PUSH
057173,000204:                                                                                          	# COUNTER IS SET TO 0 AND OVERFLOW IS CLEARED BEFORE RETURNING TO THE
057174,000205:                                                                                          	# CALLING PROGRAM.
057175,000206: 
057176,000207:                                                                                          	# 4.0 CALLING SEQUENCES AND SAMPLE CODE
057177,000208:                                                                                          	# -------------------------------------
057178,000209: 
057179,000210:                                                                                          	#       A) PRECISION ORBITAL INTEGRATION.  CSMPREC, LEMPREC ENTRANCES
057180,000211:                                                                                          	#               L-X     STORE TIME TO 95T5791T5 T 95 PUS L9ST (T4531)
057181,000212:                                                                                          	#               L       CALL
057182,000213:                                                                                          	#               L+1             CSMPREC (OR LEMPREC)
057183,000214:                                                                                          	#               L+2     RETURN
057184,000215:                                                                                          	#          INPUT                                                           28
057185,000216:                                                                                          	#               TDEC1 (PD 32D) TIME TO INTEGRATE TO...CENTISECONDS SCALED 2
057186,000217:                                                                                          	#          OUTPUT
057187,000218:                                                                                          	#               THE DATA LISTED IN SECTION 3.0 PLUS
057188,000219:                                                                                          	#               RQVV    POSITION VECTOR OF VEHICLE WITH RESPECT TO SECONDARY
057189,000220:                                                                                          	#               BODY... METERS B-29 ONLY IF MIDFLAG = DIMOFLAG = 1
057190,000221:                                                                                          	#       B) CONIC INTEGRATION.  CSMCONIC, LEMCONIC ENTRANCES
057191,000222:                                                                                          	#               L-X     STORE TIME IN PUSH LIST (TDEC1)
057192,000223:                                                                                          	#               L       CALL
057193,000224:                                                                                          	#               L+1             CSMCONIC (OR LEMCONIC)
057194,000225:                                                                                          	#          INPUT/OUTPUT
057195,000226:                                                                                          	#               SAME AS PRECISION INTEGRATION, EXCEPT RQVV NOT SET
057196,000227:                                                                                          	#       C) INTEGRATE GIVEN STATE VECTOR.  INTEGRVS ENTRANCE
057197,000228:                                                                                          	#               CALL
057198,000229:                                                                                          	#                               INTSTALL
057199,000230:                                                                                          	#               VLOAD
057200,000231:                                                                                          	#                               POSITION VECTOR
057201,000232:                                                                                          	#               STOVL           RCV
057202,000233:                                                                                          	#                               VELOCITY VECTOR
057203,000234:                                                                                          	#               STODL           VCV
057204,000235:                                                                                          	#                               TIME STATE VECTOR VALID
057205,000236:                                                                                          	#               STODL           TET
057206,000237:                                                                                          	#                               FINAL RADIUS
057207,000238:                                                                                          	#               STORE           RFINAL
057208,000239:                                                                                          	#               SET(CLEAR)      SET(CLEAR)
057209,000240:                                                                                          	#                               INTYPFLAG
057210,000241:                                                                                          	#                               MOONFLAG
057211,000242:                                                                                          	#               SET(CLEAR)      DLOAD
057212,000243:                                                                                          	#                               DESIRED TIME
057213,000244:                                                                                          	#               STCALL          TDEC1
057214,000245:                                                                                          	#                               INTEGRVS
057215,000246:                                                                                          	#         INPUT
057216,000247:                                                                                          	#               RCV     POSITION VECTOR                 METERS
057217,000248:                                                                                          	#               VCV     VELOCITY VECTOR                 M/CSEC
057218,000249:                                                                                          	#               TET     TIME OF STATE VECTOR (MAY = 0)  CSEC B-28
057220,000251:                                                                                          	#               TDEC1   TIME TO INTEGRATE TO            CSEC B-28 (PD 32D)
057221,000252:                                                                                          	#                       (MAY BE INCREMENT IF TET=0)
057222,000253:                                                                                          	#         OUTPUT
057223,000254:                                                                                          	#               SAME AS FOR PRECISION OR CONIC INTEGRATION,
057224,000255:                                                                                          	#               DEPENDING ON INTYPFLG.
057225,000256:                                                                                          	#       D) INTEGRATE STATE VECTOR.  INTGRV ENTRANCE
057226,000257:                                                                                          	#               L-X     STORE TIME IN PUSH LIST (TDEC1) (MAY BE DONE AFTER CALL TO INTSTALL)
057227,000258:                                                                                          	#               L-8     CALL
057228,000259:                                                                                          	#               L-7
057229,000260:                                                                                          	#               L-6     SET(CLEAR)      SET(CLEAR)
057230,000261:                                                                                          	#               L-5                     VINTFLAG        1=CSM, 0=LM
057231,000262:                                                                                          	#               L-4                     INTYPFLAG       1=CONIC, 0=PRECISION
057232,000263:                                                                                          	#               L-3     SET(CLEAR)      SET(CLEAR)
057233,000264:                                                                                          	#               L-2                     DIMOFLAG        1=W-MATRIX, 0=NO W-MATRIX
057234,000265:                                                                                          	#               L-1                     D6OR9FLG        1=9X9, 0=6X6
057235,000266:                                                                                          	#               L       SET             DLOAD
057236,000267:                                                                                          	#               L+1                     STATEFLG        DESIRE PERMANENT UPDATE
057237,000268:                                                                                          	#               L+2                     FINAL RAD.      OF STATE VECTOR
057238,000269:                                                                                          	#               L+3     STCALL          RFINAL
057239,000270:                                                                                          	#               L+4                     INTEGRV
057240,000271:                                                                                          	#               L       CALL                            NORMAL USE -- WILL UPDATE STATE
057241,000272:                                                                                          	#               L+1                     INTEGRV         VECTOR IF DIMOFLAG=1. (STATEFLG IS
057242,000273:                                                                                          	#               L+2     RETURN                          ALWAYS RESET IN INTEGRATION AFTER
057243,000274:                                                                                          	#                                                       IT IS USED.)
057244,000275:                                                                                          	#         INPUT
057245,000276:                                                                                          	#               TDEC1 (PD 32D) TIME TO INTEGRATE TO     CSEC B-28
057246,000277:                                                                                          	#         OUTPUT
057247,000278:                                                                                          	#               SAME AS FOR PRECISION OR CONIC INTEGRATION
057248,000279:                                                                                          	#         THE PROGRAM WILL SET MOONFLAG, MIDFLAG DEPENDING ON
057249,000280:                                                                                          	#         THE PERMANENT STATE VECTOR REPRESENTATION.
