058165,000002:                                                                                          	## Copyright:   Public domain.
058166,000003:                                                                                          	## Filename:    ORBITAL_INTEGRATION.agc
058167,000004:                                                                                          	## Purpose:     Part of the source code for Colossus 2A, AKA Comanche 055.
058168,000005:                                                                                          	##              It is part of the source code for the Command Module's (CM)
058169,000006:                                                                                          	##              Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC), for Apollo 11.
058170,000007:                                                                                          	## Assembler:   yaYUL
058171,000008:                                                                                          	## Contact:     Ron Burkey <info@sandroid.org>.
058172,000009:                                                                                          	## Website:     www.ibiblio.org/apollo.
058173,000010:                                                                                          	## Pages:       1334-1354
058174,000011:                                                                                          	## Mod history: 2009-05-14 RSB  Adapted from the Colossus249/ file of the
058175,000012:                                                                                          	##                              same name, using Comanche055 page images.
058176,000013:                                                                                          	##              2009-05-20 RSB  Corrections:  DAT -> DAD in one place, 
058177,000014:                                                                                          	##                              BWM -> BMN, DEFEQCNT -> DIFEQCNT.
058178,000015:                                                                                          	##              2010-08-27 JL   Fixed some indentation, whitespace.
058179,000016:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-22 RSB  Proofed comment text using octopus/ProoferComments
058180,000017:                                                                                          	##                              and corrected the errors found.
058181,000018:                                                                                          	##              2017-01-15 RSB  Fixed comment-text errors noted while diff'ing vs
058182,000019:                                                                                          	##                              Colossus 249.
058183,000020:                                                                                          	##              2017-03-17 RSB  Comment-text fixes identified in diff'ing
058184,000021:                                                                                          	##                              Luminary 99 vs Comanche 55.
058185,000022: 
058186,000023:                                                                                          	## This source code has been transcribed or otherwise adapted from digitized
058187,000024:                                                                                          	## images of a hardcopy from the MIT Museum.  The digitization was performed
058188,000025:                                                                                          	## by Paul Fjeld, and arranged for by Deborah Douglas of the Museum.  Many
058189,000026:                                                                                          	## thanks to both.  The images (with suitable reduction in storage size and
058190,000027:                                                                                          	## consequent reduction in image quality as well) are available online at
058191,000028:                                                                                          	## www.ibiblio.org/apollo.  If for some reason you find that the images are
058192,000029:                                                                                          	## illegible, contact me at info@sandroid.org about getting access to the 
058193,000030:                                                                                          	## (much) higher-quality images which Paul actually created.
