059802,000029:                                                                                          	##
059803,000030:                                                                                          	## Notations on the hardcopy document read, in part:
059804,000031:                                                                                          	##
059805,000032:                                                                                          	##    Assemble revision 055 of AGC program Comanche by NASA
059806,000033:                                                                                          	##    2021113-051.  10:28 APR. 1, 1969 
