060780,000094: 
060781,000095:                                                                                          	# DEBRIS
060782,000096:                                                                                          	#       ALL EXITS FROM THE CHECK OF ERASABLE (ERASCHK) RESTORE ORIGINAL CONTENTS TO REGISTERS UNDER CHECK.
060783,000097:                                                                                          	#       EXCEPTION IS A RESTART.  RESTART THAT OCCURS DURING ERASCHK RESTORES ERASABLE, UNLESS THERE IS EVIDENCE TO DOUBT
060784,000098:                                                                                          	#       E MEMORY, IN WHICH CASE PROGRAM THEN DOES A FRESH START (DOFSTART).
