061223,000015:                                                                                          	# images of a hardcopy from the MIT Museum.  The digitization was performed
061224,000016:                                                                                          	# by Paul Fjeld, and arranged for by Deborah Douglas of the Museum.  Many
061225,000017:                                                                                          	# thanks to both.  The images (with suitable reduction in storage size and
061226,000018:                                                                                          	# consequent reduction in image quality as well) are available online at
