061980,000017:                                                                                          	##                              GOTOPOOH, and I've changed them back.
061981,000018:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-22 RSB  Proofed comment text using octopus/ProoferComments
061982,000019:                                                                                          	##                              and corrected the errors found.
061983,000020:                                                                                          	##              2017-03-15 RSB  Comment-text fixes identified in 6-way
061984,000021:                                                                                          	##                              side-by-side diff of Sunburst 120 and Luminary 
061985,000022:                                                                                          	##                              69/99/116/131/210.
