061989,000026:                                                                                          	## by Paul Fjeld, and arranged for by Deborah Douglas of the Museum.  Many
061990,000027:                                                                                          	## thanks to both.  The images (with suitable reduction in storage size and
061991,000028:                                                                                          	## consequent reduction in image quality as well) are available online at
061992,000029:                                                                                          	## www.ibiblio.org/apollo.  If for some reason you find that the images are
061993,000030:                                                                                          	## illegible, contact me at info@sandroid.org about getting access to the
