063209,000024: 
063210,000025:                                                                                          	## The contents of the "Comanche055" files, in general, are transcribed 
063211,000026:                                                                                          	## from scanned documents. 
063212,000027:                                                                                          	##
063213,000028:                                                                                          	##       Assemble revision 055 of AGC program Comanche by NASA
063214,000029:                                                                                          	##       2021113-051.  April 1, 1969.  
063215,000030:                                                                                          	##
063216,000031:                                                                                          	##       This AGC program shall also be referred to as Colossus 2A
063217,000032:                                                                                          	##
063218,000033:                                                                                          	##       Prepared by
063219,000034:                                                                                          	##                       Massachusetts Institute of Technology
063220,000035:                                                                                          	##                       75 Cambridge Parkway
063221,000036:                                                                                          	##                       Cambridge, Massachusetts
063222,000037:                                                                                          	##
063223,000038:                                                                                          	##       under NASA contract NAS 9-4065.
063224,000039:                                                                                          	##
063225,000040:                                                                                          	## Refer directly to the online document mentioned above for further
063226,000041:                                                                                          	## information.  Please report any errors to info@sandroid.org.
063227,000042: 
063229,000044:                                                                                          	# DISPLAYS CAN BE CLASSIFIED INTO THE FOLLOWING CATEGORIES-
063230,000045:                                                                                          	#       1.  PRIORITY DISPLAYS - DISPLAYS WHICH TAKE PRIORITY OVER ALL OTHER DISPLAYS.  USUALLY THESE DISPLAYS ARE SENT
063231,000046:                                                                                          	#           OUT UNDER CRITICAL ALARM CONDITIONS.
063232,000047:                                                                                          	#       2.  EXTENDED VERB DISPLAYS - ALL EXTENDED VERBS AND MARK ROUTINES SHOULD USE EXTENDED VERB (MARK) DISPLAYS.
063233,000048:                                                                                          	#       3.  NORMAL DISPLAYS - ALL MISSION PROGRAM DISPLAYS WHICH INTERFACE WITH THE ASTRONAUT DURING THE NORMAL
063234,000049:                                                                                          	#           SEQUENCE OF EVENTS.
063235,000050:                                                                                          	#       4.  MISC. DISPLAYS - ALL DISPLAYS NOT HANDLED BY THE DISPLAY INTERFACE ROUTINES.  THESE INCLUDE SUCH DISPLAYS AS
063236,000051:                                                                                          	#           MM DISPLAYS AND SPECIAL PURPOSE DISPLAYS HANDLED BY PINBALL.
063237,000052:                                                                                          	#       5.  ASTRONAUT INITIATED DISPLAYS - ALL DISPLAYS INITIATED EXTERNALLY.
063238,000053: 
063239,000054:                                                                                          	# THE FOLLOWING TERMS ARE USED TO DESCRIBE THE STATUS OF DISPLAYS-
063240,000055:                                                                                          	#       1.  ACTIVE - THE DISPLAY WHICH IS (1) BEING DISPLAYED TO THE ASTRONAUT AND WAITING FOR A RESPONSE OR
063241,000056:                                                                                          	#           (2) WAITING FIRST IN LINE FOR THE ASTRONAUT TO FINISH USING THE DSKY OR (3) BEING DISPLAYED ON THE DSKY
063242,000057:                                                                                          	#           BUT NOT WAITING FOR A RESPONSE.
063243,000058:                                                                                          	#       2.  INACTIVE - A DISPLAY WHICH HAS (1) BEEN ACTIVE BUT WAS INTERRUPTED BY A DISPLAY OF HIGHER PRIORITY,
063244,000059:                                                                                          	#           (2) BEEN PUT INTO THE WAITING LIST AT TIME IT WAS REQUESTED DUE TO THE FACT A HIGHER PRIORITY DISPLAY
063245,000060:                                                                                          	#           WAS ALREADY GOING, (3) BEEN INTERRUPTED BY THE ASTRONAUT (CALLED A PINBRANCH CONDITION, SINCE THIS TYPE
063246,000061:                                                                                          	#           OF INACTIVE DISPLAY IS USUALLY REACTIVATED ONLY BY PINBALL) OR (4) A DISPLAY WHICH HAS FINISHED BUT STILL
063247,000062:                                                                                          	#           HAS INFO SAVED FOR RESTART PURPOSES.
063248,000063: 
063249,000064:                                                                                          	# DISPLAY PRIORITIES WORK AS FOLLOWS-
063250,000065:                                                                                          	#       INTERRUPTS -
063251,000066:                                                                                          	#               1.  THE ASTRONAUT CAN INTERRUPT ANY DISPLAY WITH AN EXTERNAL DISPLAY REQUEST.
063252,000067:                                                                                          	#               2.  INTERNAL DISPLAYS CAN NOT BE SENT OUT WHEN THE ASTRONAUT IS USING THE DSKY.
063253,000068:                                                                                          	#               3.  PRIORITY DISPLAYS INTERRUPT ALL OTHER TYPES OF INTERNAL DISPLAYS.  A PRIORITY DISPLAY INTERRUPTING ANOTHER
063254,000069:                                                                                          	#                   PRIORITY DISPLAY WILL CAUSE AN ABORT UNLESS BIT14 IS SET FOR THE LINUS ROUTINE.
063255,000070:                                                                                          	#               4.  A MARK DISPLAY INTERRUPTS ANY NORMAL DISPLAY.
063256,000071:                                                                                          	#               5.  A MARK THAT INTERRUPTS A MARK COMPLETELY REPLACES IT.
063257,000072: 
063258,000073:                                                                                          	#       ORDER OF WAITING DISPLAYS-
063259,000074:                                                                                          	#               1.  ASTRONAUT EXTERNAL USE
063260,000075:                                                                                          	#               2.  PRIORITY
063261,000076:                                                                                          	#               3.  INTERRUPTED MARK
063262,000077:                                                                                          	#               4.  INTERRUPTED NORMAL
063263,000078:                                                                                          	#               5.  MARK TO BE REQUESTED (SEE DESCRIPTION OF ENDMARK)
063264,000079:                                                                                          	#               6.  MARK WAITING
063265,000080:                                                                                          	#               7.  NORMAL WAITING
063266,000081: 
063268,000083:                                                                                          	# THE DISPLAY ROUTINES ARE INTENDED TO SERVE AS AN INTERFACE BETWEEN THE USER AND PINBALL.  THE
063269,000084:                                                                                          	# FOLLOWING STATEMENTS CAN BE MADE ABOUT NORMAL DISPLAYS AND PRIORITY DISPLAYS (A DESCRIPTION OF MARK ROUTINES
063270,000085:                                                                                          	# WILL FOLLOW LATER):
063271,000086:                                                                                          	#       1.  ALL ROUTINES THAT END IN R HAVE AN IMMEDIATE RETURN TO THE USER.  FOR ALL FLASHING DISPLAYS THIS RETURN
063272,000087:                                                                                          	#           IS TO THE USERS CALL CADR +4.  FOR THE ONLY NON FLASHING IMMEDIATE RETURN DISPLAY (GODSPR) THIS RETURN
063273,000088:                                                                                          	#           IS TO THE USERS CALLING LOC +1.
063274,000089:                                                                                          	#       2.  ALL ROUTINES NOT ENDING IN R DO NOT DO AN IMMEDIATE RETURN TO THE USER.
063275,000090:                                                                                          	#       3.  ALL ROUTINES THAT END IN R START A SEPARATE JOB (MAKEPLAY) WITH USERS JOB PRIORITY.
063276,000091:                                                                                          	#       4.  ALL ROUTINES NOT ENDING IN R BRANCH DIRECTLY TO MAKEPLAY WHICH MAKES THESE DISPLAYS A PART OF THE
063277,000092:                                                                                          	#           USERS JOB.
063278,000093:                                                                                          	#       5.  ALL DISPLAY ROUTINES ARE CALLED VIA BANKCALL.
063279,000094:                                                                                          	#       6.  TO RESTART A DISPLAY THE USER WILL GENERALLY USE A PHASE OF ONE WITH DESIRED RESTART GROUP (SEE
063280,000095:                                                                                          	#           DESCRIPTION OF RESTARTS).
063281,000096:                                                                                          	#       7.  ALL FLASHING DISPLAYS HAVE 3 RETURNS TO THE USER FROM ASTRONAUT RESPONSES.  A TERMINATE (V34) BRANCHES
063282,000097:                                                                                          	#           TO THE USERS CALL CADR +1.  A PROCEED (V33) BRANCHES TO THE USERS CALL CADR +2.  AN ENTER OR RECYCLE
063283,000098:                                                                                          	#           (V32) BRANCHES TO THE USERS CALL CADR +3.
063284,000099:                                                                                          	#       8.  ALL ROUTINES MUST BE USED UNDER EXECUTIVE CONTROL.
063285,000100: 
063286,000101:                                                                                          	# A DESCRIPTION OF EACH ROUTINE WITH AN EXAMPLE FOLLOWS:
063287,000102: 
063288,000103:                                                                                          	#       GODSP IS USED TO DISPLAY A VERB NOUN ARRIVING IN A.  NO RETURN IS MADE TO THE USER.
063289,000104:                                                                                          	#               1.  GODSP IS NOT RESTARTABLE
063290,000105:                                                                                          	#               2.  A VERB PASTE WITH GODSP ALWAYS TURNS ON THE FLASH.
063291,000106:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     VXXNYY
063292,000107:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063293,000108:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GODSP
063294,000109:                                                                                          	#                       VXXNYY  OCT     0XXYY
063295,000110: 
063296,000111:                                                                                          	#       GODSPR IS THE SAME AS GODSP ONLY RETURN IS TO THE USER.
063297,000112:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     VXXNYY
063298,000113:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063299,000114:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GODSPR
063300,000115:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             IMMEDIATE RETURN OF GODSPR
063301,000116: 
063302,000117:                                                                                          	#       GOFLASH DISPLAYS A FLASHING VERB NOUN WITH NO IMMEDIATE RETURN TO THE USER.  3 RETURNS ARE POSSIBLE FROM
063303,000118:                                                                                          	#       THE ASTRONAUT (SEE NO. 7 ABOVE).
063304,000119:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     VXXNYY          VXX NYY WILL BE A FLASHING VERB NOUN.
063305,000120:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063306,000121:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOFLASH
063307,000122:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             TERMINATE RETURN
063308,000123:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             PROCEED RETURN
063309,000124:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER OR RECYCLE RETURN
063310,000125: 
063311,000126:                                                                                          	#       GOPERF1 IS ENTERED WITH DESIRED CHECKLIST VALUE IN A.  GOPERF1 WILL DISPLAY THIS VALUE IN R1 BY MEANS OF A
063313,000128:                                                                                          	#       V01 N25.  A FLASHING PLEASE PERFORM ON CHECKLIST (V50 N25) IS THEN DISPLAYED.  NO IMMEDIATE RETURN IS MADE TO
063314,000129:                                                                                          	#       USER (SEE NO. 7 ABOVE).
063315,000130:                                                                                          	#       GOPERF1 BLANKS REGISTERS R2 AND R3
063316,000131:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     OCTXX           CODE FOR CHECKLIST VALUE XX
063317,000132:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063318,000133:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOPERF1
063319,000134:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             TERMINATE RETURN
063320,000135:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             PROCEED RETURN
063321,000136:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER RETURN
063322,000137:                                                                                          	#       GOPERF2 IS ENTERED WITH A VARIABLE NOUN AND V01 (V00 FOR N10 OR N11) IN A.  GOPERF2 WILL FIRST DISPLAY THE
063323,000138:                                                                                          	#       REQUESTED NOUN BY MEANS OF A V01NYY OR A V00NYY.  PLEASE PERFORM ON NOUN (V50 NYY) THEN BECOMES A FLASHING
063324,000139:                                                                                          	#       DISPLAY.  NO IMMEDIATE RETURN IS MADE TO THE USER (SEE NO. 7 ABOVE).
063325,000140:                                                                                          	#       GOPERF2 DOES NOT BLANK ANY REGISTERS
063326,000141:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     VXXNYY          VARIABLE NOUN YY. XX=00 OR 01.
063327,000142:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063328,000143:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOPERF2
063329,000144:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             TERMINATE RETURN
063330,000145:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             PROCEED RETURN
063331,000146:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER RETURN
063332,000147:                                                                                          	#       GOPERF3 IS USED FOR A PLEASE PERFORM ON A PROGRAM NUMBER.  THE DESIRED PROGRAM NO. IS ENTERED IN A.  GOPERF3
063333,000148:                                                                                          	#       DISPLAYS THE NO. BY MEANS OF A V06 N07 FOLLOWED BY A FLASHING V50 N07 FOR A PLEASE PERFORM.  NO IMMEDIATE RETURN
063334,000149:                                                                                          	#       IS MADE TO THE USER (SEE NO. 7 ABOVE).
063335,000150:                                                                                          	#       GOPERF3 BLANKS REGISTERS R2 AND R3
063336,000151:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     DECXX           REQUEST PERFORM ON PXX
063337,000152:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063338,000153:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOPERF3
063339,000154:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             TERMINATE RETURN
063340,000155:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             PROCEED RETURN
063341,000156:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER RETURN
063342,000157: 
063343,000158:                                                                                          	#       GOPERF4 IS USED FOR A PLEASE PERFORM ON AN OPTION.  THE DESIRED OPTION IS ENTERED IN A AND STORED IN OPTION1.
063344,000159:                                                                                          	#       GOPERF4 DISPLAYS R1 AND R2 BY MEANS OF A V04N06 FOLLOWED BY A FLASHING V50N06 FOR A PLEASE PERFORM.  NO
063345,000160:                                                                                          	#       IMMEDIATE RETURN IS MADE TO THE USER (SEE NO. 7 ABOVE).
063346,000161:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     OCTXX           REQUEST PERFORM ON OPTION XX
063347,000162:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063348,000163:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOPERF4
063349,000164:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             TERMINATE RETURN
063350,000165:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             PROCEED RETURN
063351,000166:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER RETURN
063352,000167:                                                                                          	#       GOPERF4 BLANKS REGISTER R3
063353,000168: 
063355,000170:                                                                                          	#       GODSPRET IS USED TO DISPLAY A VERB NOUN ARRIVING IN A WITH A RETURN TO THE USER AFTER THE DISPLAY HAS BEEN SENT
063356,000171:                                                                                          	#       OUT.
063357,000172:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     VXXNYY
063358,000173:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063359,000174:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GODSPRET
063360,000175:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             RETURN TO USER
063361,000176: 
063362,000177:                                                                                          	#       REGODSP IS USED TO DISPLAY A VERB NOUN ARRIVING IN A.  REGODSP IS THE SAME AS GODSP ONLY REGODSP REPLACES ANY
063363,000178:                                                                                          	#       ACTIVE NORMAL DISPLAY IF ONE WAS ACTIVE.
063364,000179:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     VXXNYY
063365,000180:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063366,000181:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    REGODSP
063367,000182: 
063368,000183:                                                                                          	#       REFLASH IS THE SAME AS GOFLASH ONLY REFLASH REPLACES ANY ACTIVE NORMAL DISPLAY IF ONE WAS ACTIVE.
063369,000184:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     VXXNYY          VXX NYY WILL BE A FLASHING VERB NOUN
063370,000185:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063371,000186:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    REFLASH
063372,000187:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             TERMINATE RETURN
063373,000188:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             PROCEED RETURN
063374,000189:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER RETURN
063375,000190: 
063376,000191:                                                                                          	#       GOFLASHR IS SAME AS GOFLASH ONLY AN IMMEDIATE RETURN IS MADE TO THE USERS CALL CADR +4.
063377,000192:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     VXXNYY
063378,000193:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063379,000194:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOFLASHR
063380,000195:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             TERMINATE RETURN
063381,000196:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             PROCEED RETURN
063382,000197:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER OR RECYCLE RETURN
063383,000198:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             IMMEDIATE RETURN FROM GOFLASHR
063384,000199: 
063385,000200:                                                                                          	#       GOPERF1R IS THE SAME AS GOPERF1 ONLY GOPERF1R HAS AN IMMEDIATE RETURN TO USERS CALL CADR +4.
063386,000201:                                                                                          	#       GOPERF1R BLANKS REGISTERS R2 AND R3
063387,000202:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     OCTXX           CODE FOR CHECKLIST VALUE XX.
063388,000203:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063389,000204:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOPERF1R
063390,000205:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             TERMINATE RETURN
063391,000206:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             PROCEED RETURN
063392,000207:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER RETURN
063393,000208:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             IMMEDIATE RETURN FROM GOPERF1R
063394,000209: 
063395,000210:                                                                                          	#       GOPERF2R IS THE SAME AS GOPERF2 ONLY AN IMMEDIATE RETURN IS MADE TO USERS CALL CADR +4.
063397,000212:                                                                                          	#       GOPERF2R DOES NOT BLANK ANY REGISTERS
063398,000213:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     VXXNYY          VARIABLE NOUN YY REQUESTED.  XX=00 OR 01
063399,000214:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063400,000215:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOPERF2R
063401,000216:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             TERMINATE RETURN
063402,000217:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             PROCEED RETURN
063403,000218:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER RETURN
063404,000219:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             IMMEDIATE RETURN HERE FROM GOPERF2R
063405,000220: 
063406,000221:                                                                                          	#       GOPERF3R IS THE SAME AS GOPERF3 ONLY AN IMMEDIATE RETURN IS MADE TO USERS CALL CADR +4.
063407,000222:                                                                                          	#       GOPERF3R BLANKS REGISTERS R2 AND R3
063408,000223:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     PROGXX          PERFORM PROGRAM XX
063409,000224:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063410,000225:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOPERF3R
063411,000226:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             TERMINATE RETURN
063412,000227:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             PROCEED RETURN
063413,000228:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER RETURN
063414,000229:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             GOPERF3R IMMEDIATELY RETURNS HERE
063415,000230: 
063416,000231:                                                                                          	#       GOPERF4R IS THE SAME AS GOPERF4 ONLY AN IMMEDIATE RETURN IS MADE TO USERS CALL CADR +4.
063417,000232:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     OCTXX           REQUEST PERFORM ON OPTIONXX
063418,000233:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063419,000234:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOPERF4R
063420,000235:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             TERMINATE RETURN
063421,000236:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             PROCEED RETURN
063422,000237:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER RETURN
063423,000238:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             IMMEDIATE RETURN TO USER
063424,000239:                                                                                          	#       GOPERF4R BLANKS REGISTER R3
063425,000240: 
063426,000241:                                                                                          	#       REFLASHR IS THE SAME AS REFLASH ONLY AN IMMEDIATE RETURN IS MADE TO THE USERS CALL CADR +4.
063427,000242:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     VXXNYY          VXX NYY WILL BE A FLASHING VERB NOUN
063428,000243:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063429,000244:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    REFLASHR
063430,000245:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             TERMINATE RETURN
063431,000246:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             PROCEED RETURN
063432,000247:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER RETURN
063433,000248:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             IMMEDIATE RETURN TO USER
063434,000249: 
063435,000250:                                                                                          	#       REGODSPR IS THE SAME AS REGODSP ONLY A RETURN (IMMEDIATE) IS MADE TO THE USER.
063437,000252:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     VXXNYY
063438,000253:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063439,000254:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    REGODSPR
063440,000255:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             IMMEDIATE RETURN TO USER
063441,000256: 
063443,000258:                                                                                          	#       GOMARK IS USED TO DISPLAY A MARK VERB NOUN ARRIVING IN A.  NO RETURN IS MADE TO THE USER.
063444,000259:                                                                                          	#       GOXDSP = GOMARK
063445,000260:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     VXXNYY          VXXNYY CONTAINS VERB AND NOUN
063446,000261:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063447,000262:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOMARK          OTHER EXTENDED VERBS USE CADR GOXDSP
063448,000263: 
063449,000264:                                                                                          	#       GOMARKR IS THE SAME AS GOMARK ONLY RETURN IS TO THE USER.
063450,000265:                                                                                          	#       GOXDSPR = GOMARKR
063451,000266:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     VXXNYY
063452,000267:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063453,000268:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOMARKR         OTHER EXTENDED VERBS USE CADR GOXDSPR
063454,000269: 
063455,000270:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             IMMEDIATE RETURN OF GOMARKR
063456,000271: 
063457,000272:                                                                                          	#       GOMARKF DISPLAYS A FLASHING MARK VERB NOUN WITH NO IMMEDIATE RETURN TO THE USER.  3 RETURNS ARE POSSIBLE FROM
063458,000273:                                                                                          	#       THE ASTRONAUT (SEE NO. 7 ABOVE).
063459,000274: 
063460,000275:                                                                                          	#       GOXDSPF = GOMARKF
063461,000276: 
063462,000277:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     VXXNYY          VXXNYY WILL BE A FLASHING MARK VERB NOUN
063463,000278:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063464,000279:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOMARKF         OTHER EXTENDED VERBS USE CADR GOXDSPF
063465,000280:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             TERMINATE RETURN
063466,000281:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             PROCEED RETURN
063467,000282:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER OR RECYCLE RETURN
063468,000283: 
063469,000284:                                                                                          	#       GOMARKFR IS THE SAME AS GOMARKF ONLY AN IMMEDIATE RETURN IS MADE TO THE USER CALL CADR +4.
063470,000285:                                                                                          	#       GOXDSPFR = GOMARKFR
063471,000286:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     VXXNYY          FLASHING MARK VERB NOUN
063472,000287:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063473,000288:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOMARKFR        OTHER EXTENDED VERBS USE CADR GOXDSPFR
063474,000289:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             TERMINATE RETURN
063475,000290:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             PROCEED RETURN
063476,000291:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER OR RECYCLE RETURN
063477,000292:                                                                                          	#                               
063478,000293:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             IMMEDIATE RETURN TO THE USER
063479,000294: 
063480,000295:                                                                                          	#       GOMARK1 IS USED FOR A PLEASE PERFORM ON A MARK REQUEST WITH ONLY 1 ASTRONAUT RETURN TO THE USER.  NO IMMEDIATE
063481,000296:                                                                                          	#       RETURN IS MADE.  THE DESIRED MARK PLEASE PERFORM VERB AND DESIRED NOUN IS ENTERED IN A.  GOMARK1 DISPLAYS R1, R2, R
063482,000297:                                                                                          	#       MEANS OF A V05NYY FOLLOWED BY A FLASHING V5XNYY FOR A PLEASE PERFORM.  THE ASTRONAUT WILL RESPOND WITH A MARK
063483,000298:                                                                                          	#       OR MARK REJECT OR AN ENTER.  THE ENTER IS THE ONLY ASTRONAUT RESPONSE THAT WILL COME BACK TO THE USER.
063484,000299: 
063485,000300:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     V5XNYY          X=1,2,3,4       Y=NOUN
063486,000301:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063488,000303:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOMARK1
063489,000304:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER RETURN
063490,000305: 
063491,000306:                                                                                          	#       *** IF BLANKING DESIRED ON NON R ROUTINES, NOTIFY DISPLAYER.
063492,000307: 
063493,000308:                                                                                          	#       GOMARK1R IS THE SAME AS A GOMARK1 ONLY AN IMMEDIATE RETURN IS MADE TO THE USERS CALL CADR +2.
063494,000309:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     V5XNYY          X=1,2,3,4       YY=NOUN
063495,000310:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063496,000311:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOMARK1R
063497,000312:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ASTRONAUT ENTER RETURN
063498,000313:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             IMMEDIATE RETURN TO USER
063499,000314: 
063500,000315:                                                                                          	#       GOMARK2 IS THE SAME AS GOMARK1 ONLY 3 RETURNS ARE MADE TO THE USER FROM THE ASTRONAUT.
063501,000316:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     V5XNYY          X=1,2,3,4       YY=NOUN
063502,000317:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063503,000318:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOMARK2
063504,000319:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             TERMINATE RETURN
063505,000320:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             PROCEED RETURN
063506,000321:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER RETURN
063507,000322: 
063508,000323:                                                                                          	#       GOMARK2R IS THE SAME AS GOMARK1R ONLY 3 ASTRONAUT RETURNS ARE MADE TO THE USER.
063509,000324:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     V5XNYY          X=0,1,2,3,4     YY=NOUN
063510,000325:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063511,000326:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOMARK2R
063512,000327:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             TERMINATE RETURN
063513,000328:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             PROCEED RETURN
063514,000329:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER RETURN
063515,000330:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             IMMEDIATE RETURN TO THE USER
063516,000331: 
063517,000332:                                                                                          	#       GOMARK3 IS USED FOR A PLEASE PERFORM ON A MARK REQUEST WITH A 3 COMP. DEC DISPLAY.  THE DESIRED MARK PLEASE
063518,000333:                                                                                          	#       PERFORM VERB AND NOUN ARE ENTERED IN A.  GOMARK3 DISPLAYS R1, R2, R3 BY MEANS OF A V06NYY FOLLOWED BY A FLASHING
063519,000334:                                                                                          	#       V5XNYY FOR A PLEASE PERFORM.  GOMARK3 HAS 3 ASTRONAUT RETURNS TO THE USER WITH NO IMMEDIATE RETURN.
063520,000335:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     V5XNYY          X=1,2,3,4       YY=NOUN
063521,000336:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063522,000337:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOMARK3
063523,000338:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             TERMINATE RETURN
063524,000339:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             PROCEED RETURN
063525,000340:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER RETURN
063526,000341: 
063527,000342:                                                                                          	#       GOMARK4 IS THE SAME AS GOMARK3 ONLY R2 AND R3 ARE BLANKED AND R1 IS DISPLAYED IN OCTAL.
063528,000343:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     V5XNYY          X=1,2,3,4       YY=NOUN
063529,000344:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063530,000345:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOMARK4
063531,000346:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             TERMINATE RETURN
063532,000347:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             PROCEED RETURN
063534,000349:                                                                                          	#                       ...     ...                     ENTER RETURN
063535,000350:                                                                                          	#       EXDSPRET IS USED TO DISPLAY A VERB NOUN ARRIVING IN A WITH A RETURN MADE TO THE USER AFTER THE DISPLAY HAS BEEN
063536,000351:                                                                                          	#       SENT OUT.
063537,000352:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     VXXNYY
063538,000353:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063539,000354:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    EXDSPRET
063540,000355:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             RETURN TO USER
063541,000356: 
063542,000357:                                                                                          	#       KLEENEX CLEANS OUT ALL MARK DISPLAYS (ACTIVE AND INACTIVE). A RETURN IS MADE TO THE USER AFTER THE MARK DISPLAYS
063543,000358:                                                                                          	#       HAVE BEEN CLEANED OUT.
063544,000359:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063545,000360:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    KLEENEX
063546,000361:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             RETURN TO USER
063547,000362: 
063548,000363:                                                                                          	#       MARKBRAN IS A SPECIAL PURPOSE ROUTINE USED FOR SAVING JOB VAC AREAS (SEE DESCRIPTION OF MARKBRAN BELOW).
063549,000364:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063550,000365:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    MARKBRAN
063551,000366:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             BAD RETURN IF MARK DISPLAY NOT ACTIVE
063552,000367:                                                                                          	#                                                       (GOOD RETURN TO IMMEDIATE RETURN LOC OF
063553,000368:                                                                                          	#                                                       LAST FLASHING MARK R ROUTINE)
063554,000369: 
063555,000370:                                                                                          	#       PINBRNCH REESTABLISHES THE LAST ACTIVE FLASHING DISPLAY.  IF THERE IS NO ACTIVE FLASHING DISPLAY, THE DSKY IS
063556,000371:                                                                                          	#       BLANKED AND CONTROL IS SENT TO ENDOFJOB.
063557,000372:                                                                                          	#                               TC      POSTJUMP
063558,000373:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    PINBRNCH
063559,000374: 
063560,000375:                                                                                          	#       PRIODSP IS USED AS A PRIORITY DISPLAY.  IT WILL DISPLAY A GOFLASH TYPE DISPLAY WITH THREE POSSIBLE RETURNS FROM
063561,000376:                                                                                          	#       THE ASTRONAUT (SEE NO. 7 ABOVE).
063562,000377: 
063563,000378:                                                                                          	#       THE MAIN PURPOSE OF PRIODSP IS TO REPLACE THE PRESENT DISPLAY WITH A DISPLAY OF HIGHER PRIORITY AND TO
063564,000379:                                                                                          	#       PROVIDE A MEANS FOR RESTORING THE OLD DISPLAY WHEN THE PRIORITY DISPLAY
063565,000380:                                                                                          	#       IS RESPONDED TO BY THE ASTRONAUT.
063566,000381: 
063567,000382:                                                                                          	#       THE FORMER DISPLAY IS RESTORED BY AN AUTOMATIC BRANCH TO WAKE UP THE DISPLAY THAT WAS INTERRUPTED BY THE
063568,000383:                                                                                          	#       PRIO DISPLAY.
063569,000384:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     VXXNYY          VXXNYY WILL BE A FLASHING VERB NOUN
063570,000385:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063571,000386:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    PRIODSP
063572,000387:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             TERMINATE RETURN
063573,000388:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             PROCEED RETURN
063575,000390:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER OR RECYCLE RETURN
063576,000391: 
063577,000392:                                                                                          	#       PRIODSPR IS THE SAME AS PRIODSP ONLY AN IMMEDIATE RETURN IS MADE TO THE USERS CALL CADR +4.
063578,000393:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     VXXNYY          VXXNYY WILL BE A FLASHING VERB NOUN
063579,000394:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063580,000395:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    PRIODSPR
063581,000396:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             TERMINATE RETURN
063582,000397:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             PROCEED RETURN
063583,000398:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER OR RECYCLE RETURN
063584,000399:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             IMMEDIATE RETURN
063585,000400: 
063586,000401:                                                                                          	#       PRIOLARM DOES A V05N09 PRIODSPR.
063587,000402: 
063588,000403:                                                                                          	#       CLEANDSP CLEANS OUT ALL NORMAL DISPLAYS (ACTIVE AND INACTIVE).  A RETURN IS MADE TO THE USER AFTER NORMAL
063589,000404:                                                                                          	#       DISPLAYS ARE CLEANED OUT.
063590,000405:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
063591,000406:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    CLEANDSP
063592,000407:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             RETURN TO USER
063594,000409: 
063595,000410:                                                                                          	# GENERAL INFORMATION
063596,000411:                                                                                          	# ------- -----------
063597,000412: 
063598,000413:                                                                                          	# ALARM OR ABORT EXIT MODES--
063599,000414:                                                                                          	#       PRIOBORT        TC      ABORT
063600,000415:                                                                                          	#                       OCT     1502
063601,000416: 
063602,000417:                                                                                          	#       PRIOBORT IS BRANCED TO WHEN (1) A NORMAL DISPLAY IS REQUESTED AND ANOTHER NORMAL DISPLAY IS ALREADY ACTIVE
063603,000418:                                                                                          	#       (REFLASH AND REGODSP ARE EXCEPTIONS) OR (2) A PRIORITY DISPLAY IS REQUESTED WHEN ANOTHER PRIORITY DISPLAY IS
063604,000419:                                                                                          	#       ALREADY ACTIVE (A PRIORITY WITH LINUS BIT14 IS AN EXCEPTION).
063605,000420: 
063606,000421:                                                                                          	# ERASABLE INITIALIZATION REQUIRED--
063607,000422:                                                                                          	#       ACCOMPLISHED BY FRESH START-    1.  FLAGWRD4 (USED EXCLUSIVELY BY DISPLAY INTERFACE ROUTINES)
063608,000423:                                                                                          	#                                       2.  NVSAVE = NORMAL VERB AND NOUN REGISTER.
063609,000424:                                                                                          	#                                       3.  EBANKTEM = NORMAL INACTIVE FLAGWORD (ALSO CONTAINS NORMALS EBANK).
063610,000425:                                                                                          	#                                       5.  R1SAVE = MARKBRAN CONTROL WORD
063611,000426:                                                                                          	#                                       4.  RESTREG = PRIORITY 30 AND SUPERBANK 3.
063612,000427: 
063613,000428:                                                                                          	# OUTPUT--
063614,000429:                                                                                          	#       NVWORD = PRIO VERB AND NOUN
063615,000430:                                                                                          	#       NVWORD +1(MARKNV) = MARK VERB AND NOUN
063616,000431:                                                                                          	#       NVWORD +2(NVSAVE) = NORMAL VERB AND NOUN
063617,000432: 
063618,000433:                                                                                          	#       DSPFLG (EBANKSAV) = PRIO FLAGWORD (INCLUDING EBANK)
063619,000434:                                                                                          	#       DSPFLG +1(MARKEBAN) = MARK FLAGWORD (INCLUDING EBANK)
063620,000435:                                                                                          	#       DSPFLG +2(EBANKTEM) = NORMAL FLAGWORD (INCLUDIG EBANK)
063621,000436: 
063622,000437:                                                                                          	#       CADRFLSH = PRIO USERS CALL CADR +1 LOCATION
063623,000438:                                                                                          	#       CADRFLSH +1(MARKFLSH) = MARK USERS CALL CADR +1 LOCATION
063624,000439:                                                                                          	#       CADRFLSH +2(TEMPFLSH) = NORMAL USERS CALL CADR +1 LOCATION
063625,000440: 
063626,000441:                                                                                          	#       PRIOTIME = TIME EACH PRIO REQUEST FIRST SENT OUT
063627,000442:                                                                                          	#       OPTION1 = DESIRED OPTION FROM GOPERF4
063628,000443:                                                                                          	#       FLAGWRD4 = BIT INFO FOR CONTROL OF ALL DISPLAY ROUTINES
063629,000444:                                                                                          	#       DSPTEM1 = R1 INFO FOR ASTRONAUT FROM PERFORM DISPLAYS (NORMAL)
063630,000445: 
063631,000446:                                                                                          	# SUBROUTINES USED-- NVSUB, FLAGUP, FLAGDOWN, ENDOFJOB, BLANKSUB, ABORT, JOBWAKE, JOBSLEEP, FINDVAC, PRIOCHNG,
063632,000447:                                                                                          	#       JAMTERM, NVSUBUSY, FLASHON, ENDIDLE, CHANG1, BANKJUMP, MAKECADR, NOVAC,
063633,000448: 
063634,000449:                                                                                          	# DEBRIS-- (STORED INTO)
063635,000450:                                                                                          	#       TEMPORARY TEMPORARIES - A, Q, L, MPAC +2, MPAC +3, MPAC +4, MPAC +5, MPAC +6, RUPTREG2, RUPTREG3, CYL,
063636,000451:                                                                                          	# EBANK, RUPTREG4, LOC, BANKSET, MODE, MPAC, MPAC +1                        4, FACEREG
063637,000452:                                                                                          	#       ERASABES (SHARED AND USED WITH OTHER PROGRAMS) CADRSTOR, DSPLIST, LOC, DSPTEM1, OPTION1
063638,000453:                                                                                          	#       ERASABLES (USED ONLY BY DISPLAY ROUTINES) - NVWORD,+1,+2, DSPFLG,+1,+2, CADRFLSH,+1,+2, PRIOTIME, FLAGWRD4,
063640,000455:                                                                                          	#               R1SAVE, MARK2PAC,
063641,000456: 
063642,000457:                                                                                          	# DEBRIS-- (USED BUT NOT STORED INTO) - NOUNREG, VERBREG, LOCCTR, MONSAVE1
063643,000458: 
063644,000459:                                                                                          	# FLAGWORD DESCRIPTIONS--
063645,000460:                                                                                          	#       FLAGWRD4 - SEE DESCRIPTION UNDER LOG SECTION ERASABLE ASSIGNMENTS
063646,000461: 
063647,000462:                                                                                          	#       DSPFLG, DSPFLG+1, DSPFLG +2-
063648,000463:                                                                                          	#       ----------------------------
063649,000464:                                                                                          	#       BITS 1  BLANK R1
063650,000465:                                                                                          	#            2  BLANK R2
063651,000466:                                                                                          	#            3  BLANK R3
063652,000467:                                                                                          	#            4  FLASHING DISPLAY REQUESTED
063653,000468:                                                                                          	#            5  PERFORM DISPLAY REQUESTED
063654,000469:                                                                                          	#            6  -----                   EXDSPRET                GODSPRET
063655,000470:                                                                                          	#            7  PRIO DISPLAY            -----                   -----
063656,000471:                                                                                          	#            8  -----                   DEC MARK PERFORM        -----
063657,000472:                                                                                          	#            9  EBANK
063658,000473:                                                                                          	#           10  EBANK
063659,000474:                                                                                          	#           11  EBANK
063660,000475:                                                                                          	#           12  -----                   -----                   V99PASTE
063661,000476:                                                                                          	#           13  2ND PART OF PERFORM
063662,000477:                                                                                          	#           15  REFLASH OR REDO         -----                   REFLASH OR REDO
063663,000478:                                                                                          	#           15  -----                   MARK REQUEST            -----
063664,000479: 
063665,000480:                                                                                          	# RESTARTING DISPLAYS--
063666,000481: 
063667,000482:                                                                                          	# RULES FOR THE DSKY OPERATOR --
063668,000483:                                                                                          	#       1.  PROCEED AND TERMINATE SERVE AS RESPONSES TO REQUESTS FOR OPERATOR RESPONSE (FLASHING V/N).  AS LONG
063669,000484:                                                                                          	#           AS THERE IS ANY REQUEST AWAITING OPERATOR RESPONSE, ANY USE OF PROCEED OR TERMINATE WILL SERVE AS
063670,000485:                                                                                          	#           RESPONSES TO THAT REQUEST.  CARE SHOULD BE EXERCISED IN ATTEMPTING TO KILL AN OPERATOR INITIATED MONITOR
063671,000486:                                                                                          	#           WITH PROCEED AND TERMINATE FOR THIS REASON.
063672,000487:                                                                                          	#       2.  THE ASTRONAUT MUST RESPOND TO A PRIORITY DISPLAY NO SOONER THAN 5 SECS FROM THE TIME THE MISSION
063673,000488:                                                                                          	#           PROGRAM SENT OUT THE REQUEST FOR OPERATOR RESPONSE (THE ASTRONAUT WOULD SEE THIS DISPLAY FOR LESS TIME
063674,000489:                                                                                          	#           DUE TO TIME IT TAKES TO GET DISPLAY SENT OUT.)  IF THE ASTRONAUT RESPONDS TOO SOON, THE PRIORITY DISPLAY
063675,000490:                                                                                          	#           IS SENT OUT AGAIN---AND AGAIN UNTIL AN ACCUMULATED 5 SECS FROM TIME THE FIRST PRIORITY DISPLAY WAS SENT
063676,000491:                                                                                          	#           OUT.  THE SAME 5 SEC. DELAY WILL OCCUR AT 163.84 SECS OR IN ANY MULTIPLE OF THAT TIME DUE TO PROGRAM
063677,000492:                                                                                          	#           CONSIDERATION.
063678,000493:                                                                                          	#       3.  KEY RELEASE BUTTON -
063679,000494:                                                                                          	#           A)  IF THE KEY RELEASE LIGHT IS ON, IT SIMPLY RELEASES THE KEYBOARD AND DISPLAY FOR INTERNAL USE.
063680,000495:                                                                                          	#           B)  IF THE KEY RELEASE LIGHT IS OFF, AND IF SOME REQUEST FOR OPERATOR RESPONSE (FLASHING V/N) IS STILL
063681,000496:                                                                                          	#               AWAITING RESPONSE THEN IT RE-ESTABLISHES THE DISPLAYS THAT ORIGINALLY REQUESTED RESPONSE.
063682,000497:                                                                                          	#           IF AN OPERATOR WANTS THEREFORE TO RE-ESTABLISH BUT CONDITION (A) IS ENCOUNTERED, A SECOND DEPRESSION OF
063683,000498:                                                                                          	#           KEY RELEASE BUTTON MAY BE NECESSARY.
063684,000499:                                                                                          	#       4.  IT IS IMPORTANT TO ANSWER ALL REQUESTS FOR OPERATOR RESPONSE.
063685,000500:                                                                                          	#       5.  IT IS ALWAYS GOOD PRACTICE TO TERMINATE AN EXTENDED VERB BEFORE ASKING FOR ANOTHER ONE OR THE SAME ONE
063686,000501:                                                                                          	#           OVER AGAIN.
063687,000502: 
063688,000503:                                                                                          	# SPECIAL CONSIDERATIONS--
063690,000505:                                                                                          	#       1.  MPAC +2 SAVED ONLY IN MARK DISPLAYS
063691,000506:                                                                                          	#       2.  GODSP(R), REGODSP(R), GOMARK(R) ALWAYS TURN ON THE FLASH IF ENTERED WITH A PASTE VERB REQUEST.
063692,000507:                                                                                          	#       3.  ALL NORMAL DISPLAYS ARE RESTARTABLE EXCEPT GODSP(R), REGODSP(R)
063693,000508:                                                                                          	#       4.  ALL EXTENDED VERBS WITH DISPLAYS SHOULD START WITH A TC TESTXACT AND FINISH WITH A TC ENDEXT.
063694,000509:                                                                                          	#       5.  GODSP(R) AND REGODSP(R) MUST BE IN THE SAME EBANK AND SUPERBANK AS THE LAST NORMAL DISPLAY RESTARTED
063695,000510:                                                                                          	#           BY A .1 RESTART PHASE CHANGE.
063696,000511:                                                                                          	#       6.  IN ORDER TO SET UP A NON DISPLAY .1 RESTART POINT, THE USER MUST MAKE CERTAIN THAT RESTREG CONTAINS THE
063697,000512:                                                                                          	#           CORRECT PRIORITY AND SUPERBANK AND THAT EBANKTEM CONTAINS THE CO
063698,000513:                                                                                          	#       7.  IF CLEANDSP IS RESTARTED VIA A .1 PHASE CHANGE, CAF ZERO SHOULD BE EXECUTED BEFORE THE TC BANKCALL.
063699,000514: 
063701,000516:                                                                                          	# CALLING SEQUENCE FOR BLANKING
