063842,000657:                                                                                          	# PINCHEK CHECKS TO SEE IF THE CURRENT MARK REQUEST IS MADE BY THE ASTRONAUT WHILE INTERRUPTING A GOPLAY DISPLAY
063843,000658:                                                                                          	# (A NORMAL OR A PRIO).  IF THE ASTRONAUT TRIES TO MARK DURING A PRIO, THE CHECK FAIL LIGHT GOES ON AND THE MARK
063844,000659:                                                                                          	# REQUEST IS ENDED.  IF HE TRIES TO MARK DURING A NORM, THE MARK IS ALLOWED.  IN THIS CASE THE NORM IS PUT TO SLEEP
063845,000660:                                                                                          	# UNTIL ALL MARKING IS FINISHED.
063846,000661: 
063847,000662:                                                                                          	# IF THE MARK REQUEST COMES FROM THE PROGRAM DURING A TIME THE ASTRONAUT IS NOT INTERRUPTING A NORMAL OR A
063848,000663:                                                                                          	# PRIO, THE MARK REQUEST IS PUT TO SLEEP UNTIL THE +RESENT ACTIVE DISPLAY IS RESPONDED TO BY THE ASTRONAUT.
