064689,000004:                                                                                          	## Purpose:     Part of the source code for Comanche, build 055. It
064690,000005:                                                                                          	##              is part of the source code for the Command Module's
064691,000006:                                                                                          	##              (CM) Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC), Apollo 11.
064692,000007:                                                                                          	## Assembler:   yaYUL
