064696,000011:                                                                                          	## Mod history: 2009-05-07 RSB  Adapted from Colossus249 file of the same
064697,000012:                                                                                          	##                              name, and page images. Corrected various 
064698,000013:                                                                                          	##                              typos in the transcription of program 
